('page',	0,	280,	280,	'und',	0,	'<div><span style=\"color:#000000;\">The OpenFOAM Project, FOSSEE, IIT Bombay, partners with faculty members from all over India and abroad. Any faculty member who looks forward to contributing in the project can join us as any one of the following:</span></div><p><span style=\"color:#000000;\">To view the roles and responsibilities of the Faculty Partners, please </span><a href=\"https://cfd.fossee.in/faculty-partners-roles\" target=\"_blank\">click here</a>.&nbsp;<!-- Principal Investigator ,photo , name --></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h4>Principal Investigator</h4><p>&nbsp;</p><img src=\"https://cfd.fossee.in/sites/default/files/Prof.%20Chandan.jpg\"><p><a href=\"https://cfd.fossee.in/advisor\">Prof. Chandan Bose</a></p><!--<div><a href=\"https://cfd.fossee.in/advisor\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD;\">Advisor</span></a></div>\r\n\r\n<div><a href=\"https://cfd.fossee.in/coaching-partners\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">Coaching Partner</font></a></div>\r\n\r\n<div><a href=\"https://cfd.fossee.in/executive-partners\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">Executive Partner</font></a></div>\r\n\r\n<div><a href=\"https://cfd.fossee.in/senior-executive-partners\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">Senior Executive Partner</font></a></div>\r\n\r\n<div><a href=\"https://cfd.fossee.in/former-faculty-partners\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">Former Faculty Partners</font></a></div>--><!--<p><u>Roles &amp; Responsibilities</u></p>\r\n<p><strong>Option 1</strong></p>\r\n<p>Guide 1 or more summer/ semester long internship student of the OpenFOAM Project, FOSSEE, IITB, to produce a case study/ research migration/ lab migration projects&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;PLUS</p>\r\n<p>Participate&nbsp;in any workshop/ seminar/ conference organized by the OpenFOAM Project, FOSSEE, IIT Bombay</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;<strong>Option 2</strong></p>\r\n<p>Guide 1 summer/ semester long internship student of the OpenFOAM Project, FOSSEE, IITB, to produce a case study/ research migration/ lab migration projects&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; PLUS</p>\r\n<p>Contribute to our Lab Migration Project (Course update needed every 4 years)&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Option 3</strong></p>\r\n<p>Encourage 4 students per year to submit case studies, research migration projects and research papers for conferences and journals&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>--><p><u>List of Executive Partners of OpenFOAM Project, FOSSEE, IIT Bombay</u></p><p><u>[view:list_of_partners=list_of_executive_partners]</u></p><!--?php\r\nprint views_embed_view(\'list_of_partners\', \'list_of_executive_partners\');\r\n?--><!--<p><u>Roles &amp; Responsibilities</u></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Guide 1 summer fellowship or semester long internship student of the OpenFOAM Project, FOSSEE, IITB, to produce a case study/ research migration/ lab migration project&nbsp;or publish a conference paper acknowledging the FOSSEE project, IIT Bombay.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 300px;\">OR</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Deliver a talk and participate in any workshop/ seminar/ conference organized by the OpenFOAM Project, FOSSEE, IIT Bombay.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>--><p><u>List of Coaching Partners of OpenFOAM Project, FOSSEE, IIT Bombay</u></p><p><u>[view:list_of_partners=list_of_coaching_partners]</u></p><!--?php\r\nprint views_embed_view(\'list_of_partners\', \'list_of_coaching_partners\');\r\n?--><!--<p><u>List of Senior Executive Partners of OpenFOAM Project, FOSSEE, IIT Bombay</u></p>--><!--?php\r\nprint views_embed_view(\'list_of_partners\', \'list_of_senior_executive_partners\');\r\n?--><p><u>List of Former Faculty Partners of OpenFOAM Project, FOSSEE, IIT Bombay</u></p><p><u>[view:list_of_partners=list_of_former_faculty_partners]</u></p><!--?php\r\nprint views_embed_view(\'list_of_partners\', \'list_of_former_faculty_partners\');\r\n?-->',	'',	'full_html'),
('page',	0,	281,	281,	'und',	0,	'<p><u>Roles &amp; Responsibilities</u></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Guide 1 summer fellowship or semester long internship student of the OpenFOAM Project, FOSSEE, IITB, to produce a case study/ research migration/ lab migration project&nbsp;or publish a conference paper acknowledging the FOSSEE project, IIT Bombay.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 300px;\">OR</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Deliver a talk and participate in any workshop/ seminar/ conference organized by the OpenFOAM Project, FOSSEE, IIT Bombay.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><u>List of Coaching Partners of OpenFOAM Project, FOSSEE, IIT Bombay</u></p>\r\n<!--<?php\r\nprint views_embed_view(\'list_of_partners\', \'list_of_coaching_partners\');\r\n?>-->\r\n\r\n',	'',	'php_code'),
('page',	0,	282,	282,	'und',	0,	'<p><u>Roles &amp; Responsibilities</u></p>\r\n<p><strong>Option 1</strong></p>\r\n<p>Guide 1 or more summer/ semester long internship student of the OpenFOAM Project, FOSSEE, IITB, to produce a case study/ research migration/ lab migration projects&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;PLUS</p>\r\n<p>Participate&nbsp;in any workshop/ seminar/ conference organized by the OpenFOAM Project, FOSSEE, IIT Bombay</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;<strong>Option 2</strong></p>\r\n<p>Guide 1 summer/ semester long internship student of the OpenFOAM Project, FOSSEE, IITB, to produce a case study/ research migration/ lab migration projects&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; PLUS</p>\r\n<p>Contribute to our Lab Migration Project (Course update needed every 4 years)&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Option 3</strong></p>\r\n<p>Encourage 4 students per year to submit case studies, research migration projects and research papers for conferences and journals&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><u>List of Executive Partners of OpenFOAM Project, FOSSEE, IIT Bombay</u></p>\r\n<?php\r\nprint views_embed_view(\'list_of_partners\', \'list_of_executive_partners\');\r\n?>\r\n\r\n',	'',	'php_code'),
('page',	0,	283,	283,	'und',	0,	'<p><u>Roles &amp; Responsibilities</u></p>\r\n<p><strong>Option 1</strong></p>\r\n<p>Guide 3 students under the FOSSEE Fellowship (Summer intern/ semester long intern)</p>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 90px;\">PLUS</p>\r\n<p>Contribute to our Lab Migration Project (Course update needed every 4 years)</p>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 90px;\">PLUS</p>\r\n<p>Encourage 3 students per year to submit case studies, research migration projects and research papers for conferences and journals&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 90px;\">PLUS</p>\r\n<p>Contribute in our training workshops throughout the year, as a mentor</p>\r\n<p><strong>Option 2</strong></p>\r\n<p>Organize a one-day event (conference/ introductory workshop/ competition) to invite institutes in your district/ state to promote the OpenFOAM Project of FOSSEE, IIT Bombay.</p>\r\n<p><u>List of Senior Executive Partners of OpenFOAM Project, FOSSEE, IIT Bombay</u></p>\r\n<?php\r\nprint views_embed_view(\'list_of_partners\', \'list_of_senior_executive_partners\');\r\n?>',	'',	'php_code'),
('list_of_faculty_partners',	0,	284,	284,	'und',	0,	'<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong>Designation:</strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; margin: 0px; outline: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252);\" xml:lang=\"EN-IN\">Associate Professor, Chemical Engineering<br />\r\nSchool of Chemical &amp; Biotechnology (SCBT)</span><br style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252);\" />\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252);\">SASTRA Deemed to be University</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>LinkedIn Profile:&nbsp;</strong>https://www.linkedin.com/in/prnaren/</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><strong>Areas of interest:</strong>&nbsp;1. Multiphase Flows - Gas Solid and Gas Liquid 2. Mixing and RTD 3. Comparison with commercial tools</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong><font color=\"#555555\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252);\">Students guided:</span></font></strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>1) Name: Chaitanya Apte</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Course: FOSSEE Summer Fellowship, 2022</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Institute: VJTI, Mumbai</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Link for Research Migration:&nbsp;https://cfd.fossee.in/research-migration-project/research-migration-run/29</p>\r\n\r\n<p>2) Name: Nishit Pachpande</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Institute: BITS Pilani Goa</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Link for Research Migration:&nbsp;https://cfd.fossee.in/research-migration-project/research-migration-run/40</p>\r\n\r\n<p>3) Name: Pranay Kumar Pande</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Course: FOSSEE Summer Fellowship</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Institute: Amity University Mumbai</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Link for Case Study:&nbsp;https://cfd.fossee.in/case-study-project/case-study-run/244</p>\r\n\r\n<p>4) Name: Saarth Shukla</p>\r\n<p>Institute: National Institute of Technology, Delhi</p>\r\n<p>Link for Case Study Project: <a href=\"https://cfd.fossee.in/case-study-project/case-study-run/294\">here</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Contribution:&nbsp;</strong>Conducted a session on \'<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: docs-Calibri; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Heat transfer problem for flow through a pipe</span>\', during the online workshop on the Basics of CFD &amp; OpenFOAM, organized by the FOSSEE Project, IIT Bombay, during 11-13 Jan 2023.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Link to the completed Case Study Projects</strong>:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Chaitanya Apte- https://cfd.fossee.in/case-study-project/case-study-run/224</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Nishit Pachpande-&nbsp;https://cfd.fossee.in/research-migration-project/research-migration-run/40</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n',	'',	'full_html'),
