dfd;\">Janhavi Deshpande,&nbsp;Veermata Jijabai Technological Institute:&nbsp;</span>Link to Case Study Project: <a href=\"https://cfd.fossee.in/case-study-project/case-study-run/277\">Click here</a></span></span></p>\r\n<p>9) Prajit Dhakal<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fdfdfd;\">, Tribhuvan University:&nbsp;</span>Link to Case Study Project: <a href=\"https://cfd.fossee.in/case-study-project/case-study-run/296\">Click here</a></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Contribution towards workshop lectures:</span></span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: #222222;\">1. Topic of talk : Modeling of compressible flow, &nbsp;presented by Prof.&nbsp;</span><span class=\"il\" style=\"color: #222222;\">Manimaran</span><span style=\"color: #222222;\">&nbsp;R in OpenFOAM_Workshop : Tackling Computational Fluid Dynamics and Heat Transfer Problems using OpenFOAM,&nbsp; Time : 2:00 p.m-3:00 p.m, Date: 21 Feb 2024</span><br style=\"color: #222222; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\" /> <span style=\"color: #222222;\">2. Topic of Talk : Introduction to OpenFOAM, Presented by Prof.&nbsp;</span><span class=\"il\" style=\"color: #222222;\">Manimaran</span><span style=\"color: #222222;\">&nbsp;R in Online workshop on OpenFOAM : TechnoVIT event at Vellore Institute of Technology, Chennai, Time : 5.30 PM to 7.30 PM, Dates: 5-7 Sep 2023</span></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: #222222;\">3.&nbsp;Topic of Talk : Modeling two phase flow in OpenFOAM, presented by Prof. Manimaran &nbsp;in FOSSEE, IIT BOMBAY, Faculty Development Program on CFD-OpenFOAM 2025, Time : 11.30 am to 12.15 pm, 13 June 2025</span></span></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>',	'',	'full_html'),
