('list_of_faculty_partners',	0,	289,	289,	'und',	0,	'<p><strong>Designation:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Associate Professor</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Institute:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>IIT Guwahati</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>LinkedIn Profile:</strong>&nbsp;https://www.linkedin.com/in/raghvendra-gupta-ab467a9/</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Areas of&nbsp;interest:&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 14.6667px;\">Microfluidics, Multiphase Flows and Physiological Flows</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Students Guided</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Name: Biraj Khadka</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Institute: Tribhuvan University</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Research Migration Link:&nbsp;https://cfd.fossee.in/research-migration-project/research-migration-run/47&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Contribution:</strong> Conducted a session \'Lecture on Turbulent Flows\' during the online workshop on the Basics of CFD &amp; OpenFOAM, organized by the FOSSEE Project, IIT Bombay, during 11-13 Jan 2023.</p>\r\n',	'',	'full_html'),
('news_and_events',	0,	291,	291,	'und',	0,	'<p>We are accepting invitation for the&nbsp;FOSSEE Summer Fellowship for OpenFOAM Project, 2023. Students of any academic year, with a basic knowledge of CFD can apply for the fellowship. The duration of the fellowship is approximately 4-6 weeks and mode is online.&nbsp;The only criteria to get selected is, solving a screening task.&nbsp;Please find the details about the screening task as below:</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Screening task for OpenFOAM:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-65761323-7fff-edbe-aa6a-deccca76c928\"><em><span style=\"font-size: 11.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Flow Past a Prism:</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 11.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong><em> </em></strong>This task aims to find the Drag and Lift coefficients for flow around a triangular prism of Length one meter, as shown in the figure <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/13eLY5ZGx4uNywuJuMowHbUVSqTQoTWTe/view\">here</a></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span><span style=\"font-size: 11.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Applicants can submit the solution of the screening task at contact-cfd@fossee.in</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><em><span><span style=\"font-size: 11.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Screening task for OpenFOAM GUI:</span></span></em></strong><span><span style=\"font-size: 11.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong><em>&nbsp;</em></strong></span></span><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-8f83e524-7fff-a8ca-058a-3b56e33048fa\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">The CFD-FOSSEE team is developing a GUI to enhance the convenience of creating OpenFOAM cases. This involves building a PyQt based node-editor to manipulate the contents of serialized data files (such as a json). The serialized data represents the various parameters required to build an OpenFOAM case.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Arial\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">The screening task for OpenFOAM GUI and submission guidelines will be announced shortly.</span></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n',	'',	'full_html'),
('page',	0,	293,	293,	'und',	0,	'<p class=\"rteright\"><span>Please keep visiting this page for updates</span><br />\r\n<span>Last updated on: 04 April 2024</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span><strong>The FOSSEE Summer Fellowship 2024&nbsp;will tentatively be offered physically (on-site). The FOSSEE team will contact the selected candidates through emails. </strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<p><span><strong>Registration And Important Dates: </strong></span><br />\r\n<span>The link for registration and important dates are available <a href=\"https://fossee.in/fellowship/2024\">here</a></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span><strong>Screening Tasks Links:</strong></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<div>Please select your screening task as per the choice filled while registering for the summer fellowship.</div>\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n<table>\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><strong>OpenFOAM</strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong>OpenFOAM GUI</strong></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1EJDDJLkmCLh_2N3DEvKeMbB7LgKyCCQF/view\" target=\"_blank\">OpenFOAM Screening Task</a></td>\r\n			<td><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/126K8K61vgWdGQc20mg5Vyz13cVkLHxBa/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">OpenFOAM GUI Screening Task</a></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"color:#008000;\"><strong>Resources to learn OpenFOAM:</strong></span><span><strong> </strong></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li>Start learning OpenFOAM using the <a href=\"https://spoken-tutorial.org/tutorial-search/?search_foss=OpenFOAM+version+7\" target=\"_blank\">Spoken Tutorials on OpenFOAM</a>.</li>\r\n	<li>To learn more about OpenFOAM, please refer to the <a href=\"http://foam.sourceforge.net/docs/Guides-a4/OpenFOAMUserGuide-A4.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">OpenFOAM User Guide</a>.</li>\r\n	<li>Refer to the <a href=\"https://cfd.fossee.in/case-study-project/completed-case-studies\" target=\"_blank\">Completed Case Studies</a> to get a fair idea about the Case Study Project.</li>\r\n	<li>Refer to the <a href=\"https://cfd.fossee.in/research-migration-project/completed-research-migration\" target=\"_blank\">Completed Research Migration</a> to get a fair idea about the Research Migration Project.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"color:#008000;\"><strong>Screening Task for the OpenFOAM Project:</strong></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li>Participants are requested to visit&nbsp;<a href=\"https://fossee.in/fellowship/2024\">https://fossee.in/fellowship/2024</a>&nbsp;to view the Screening Task for the OpenFOAM Project</li>\r\n	<li>Participants are expected to<strong> finish their assignment </strong>within <strong>10 days</strong>&nbsp;from registration.</li>\r\n	<li>Participants are requested to <strong>perform the task independently. </strong>Any form of copying is strongly discouraged. Stringent <strong>plagiarism checks</strong> will be done at FOSSEE, IIT Bombay, and any <strong>malpractice</strong> found will result in <strong>disqualification</strong>.</li>\r\n	<li>Selections for the fellowship will be based on your performance in this task. The decision of the FOSSEE selection team will be final.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p><span>For any further queries, write to us at</span> <a href=\"mailto:contact-cfd@fossee.in\">contact-cfd@fossee.in</a>&nbsp;<span>with the subject line “<strong>FOSSEE Summer Fellowship 2023</strong>”</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span><span><strong>Note</strong></span>: A candidate must complete the screening task to be eligible for the fellowship.</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"color:#008000;\"><strong>OpenFOAM GUI:</strong></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"color:#008000;\"><strong>Screening Task for the OpenFOAM GUI Project:</strong></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The CFD-FOSSEE team is developing a GUI application to conveniently generate OpenFOAM cases. For details regarding Resources and Screening Task for the FOSSEE Summer Fellowship on OpenFOAM GUI Project, please click <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1L_7NBiJxTuEv0IDLVvBPJf1R9lxRLTVMgIuxqYVQAjA/edit\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"color:#008000;\"><strong>Benefits of Fellowship:</strong></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li>Mention in the URL of FOSSEE, IIT Bombay</li>\r\n	<li><span>Opportunity to work with OpenFOAM-CFD experts in FOSSEE, IIT Bombay</span></li>\r\n	<li><span>Certificate of FOSSEE Summer Fellowship 2024</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n',	'',	'full_html'),
('page',	0,	294,	294,	'und',	0,	'<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">The OpenFOAM Project, FOSSEE, IIT Bombay, invites applications for full-time employees to join as Research Assistants and Research Associates. Holders of Bachelors and Masters degrees in engineering can apply for the jobs. Knowledge of OpenFOAM or Python and Blender are mandatory for the job application.</font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#800080;\"><span class=\"im\">To apply for jobs please go through the links given below:</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td style=\"width:255px;\">\r\n			<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\">OpenFOAM</span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td style=\"width:346px;\">\r\n			<p><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1T7XKNXNw6-OQH4pR8iJcxE7dS-LC5LQ8/view?usp=sharing\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1T7XKNXNw6-OQH4pR8iJcxE7dS-LC5LQ8/view?usp=sharing</a></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td style=\"width:255px;\">\r\n			<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\">OpenFOAM GUI</span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td style=\"width:346px;\">\r\n			<p><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1QcP64hve7LbSjYYi1uuhe3UB2MCGfQV8/view?usp=sharing\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1QcP64hve7LbSjYYi1uuhe3UB2MCGfQV8/view?usp=sharing</a></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\">Applicants can learn the mentioned software using self-learning tools known as the Spoken Tutorials, available in the following links:</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">OpenFOAM:</span>&nbsp;<a data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://cfd.fossee.in/resources&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1685774687620000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1VOCrlV6qUqemZQkjAgtKT\" href=\"https://cfd.fossee.in/resources\" target=\"_blank\">https://cfd.fossee.<wbr />in/resources</a></font></div>\r\n\r\n<div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">Previously completed case studies, by the students across the country, are available at</span>:&nbsp;</font>https://cfd.fossee.in/case-study-project/completed-case-studies</div>\r\n\r\n<div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">Python:&nbsp;</span><a data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://spoken-tutorial.org/tutorial-search/?search_foss%3DPython%2B3.4.3%26search_language%3DEnglish&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1685774687620000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1oLQ8FEfAVumXycGlTeOd7\" href=\"https://spoken-tutorial.org/tutorial-search/?search_foss=Python+3.4.3&amp;search_language=English\" target=\"_blank\">https://spoken-<wbr />tutorial.org/tutorial-search/?<wbr />search_foss=Python+3.4.3&amp;<wbr />search_language=English</a></font></div>\r\n\r\n<div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">Blender:</span>&nbsp;<a data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://spoken-tutorial.org/tutorial-search/?search_foss%3DBlender%26search_language%3DEnglish&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1685774687620000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3mhUJAGGxdC5DFfpW6sFjO\" href=\"https://spoken-tutorial.org/tutorial-search/?search_foss=Blender&amp;search_language=English\" target=\"_blank\">https://spoken-<wbr />tutorial.org/tutorial-search/?<wbr />search_foss=Blender&amp;search_<wbr />language=English</a></font></div>\r\n\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<p><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">The OpenFOAM Team of FOSSEE, IIT Bombay, invites the students and faculty members of your institution to join us for a <strong>Recruitment Interaction&nbsp;Session</strong>, to be held in the month of July 2023. Please click <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSe0vbYnQ_77JfIvQEe73HFimyCPqu76GYjABNGq4w6PXe9Apg/viewform?usp=pp_url\">here</a></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#000000;\">to register yourselves for the event</span>.&nbsp;</font></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">The former employees and interns of the OpenFOAM Team, FOSSEE, IIT Bombay, are placed in corporations like Mercedes-Benz, Tata Motors, UFI Filters. Some of them are into academia in institutions e.g., The University of Manchester,&nbsp;</span></font><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, sans-serif;\">TU Braunschweig (Germany), TU Darmstadt (Germany),&nbsp;</span><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">IIT Bombay, CUSAT Mysore. To view the testimonials of our former employees and interns, please <a data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://cfd.fossee.in/testimonials&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1685774687620000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3o3juI4O9WcyJDfMqzdea8\" href=\"https://cfd.fossee.in/testimonials\" target=\"_blank\">click here</a> .</span></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p>To apply&nbsp;for the RA (Research Assistant/ Research Associate) positions for OpenFOAM and OpenFOAM GUI development, please submit your CV at <strong>contact-cfd@fossee.in</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<!--<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\">To apply for job, please submit your CV to </span><a href=\"mailto:contact-cfd@fossee.in\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">contact-cfd@fossee.in</span></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\">Recruitment will be based on a screening task. Interviews will be conducted in case the candidate qualifies the screening task round.</span></p>-->',	'',	'full_html'),
('page',	0,	299,	299,	'und',	0,	'<p>List of Former Faculty Partners of OpenFOAM Project, FOSSEE, IIT Bombay</p>\r\n<?php\r\nprint views_embed_view(\'list_of_partners\', \'list_of_former_faculty_partners\');\r\n?>',	'',	'php_code'),
('page',	0,	300,	300,	'und',	0,	'<div style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"text-align: justify;\">The OpenFOAM Hackathon was&nbsp;a platform for the CFD-OpenFOAM community to show their skills in OpenFOAM. Participants&nbsp;upgraded solved Case Studies into the latest versions of OpenFOAM&nbsp; (v10 and v2212) according to the standards of</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</span><a data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://openfoam.org/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1699686804826000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3nzV8aRaLmKjafToygFmDc\" href=\"https://openfoam.org/\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 123, 255); box-sizing: border-box; text-decoration-line: none; font-family: Open-sans; font-size: 16px; text-align: justify;\" target=\"_blank\">openfoam.org</a><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"text-align: justify;\">or</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</span><a data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.openfoam.com/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1699686804827000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2f263RkTqpCh6XF_J6VwDo\" href=\"https://www.openfoam.com/\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 123, 255); box-sizing: border-box; text-decoration-line: none; font-family: Open-sans; font-size: 16px; text-align: justify;\" target=\"_blank\">openfoam.<wbr />com</a><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); text-align: justify;\">.</span></span></span></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">FOSSEE, IIT Bombay, has reopened the platform for the&nbsp;CFD enthusiasts to continue this activity. Anyone can&nbsp;pick&nbsp;up any&nbsp;case study and&nbsp;upgrade it to the latest version of OpenFOAM (v10 and v2212). The participants are expected to submit the case files of the upgraded case study, along with the report. The participants are also expected to do at least 2 peer reviews. FOSSEE, IIT Bombay, will pay an honorarium of Rs. 500 to an individual participant on completion of one case study upgradation plus two peer reviews. FOSSEE, IIT Bombay, will recognise the contribution of each participant, their institute and their guide, through a&nbsp;URL. Participants can avail the opportunity of referring&nbsp;the&nbsp;URL&nbsp;anytime in future.&nbsp;</span></span></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Please follow the instructions below to participate in the Case Study Upgradation Activity of the OpenFOAM Project, FOSSEE, IIT Bombay:</span></span></span></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">Step 1: Click</span> <a href=\"https://cfd.fossee.in/cfd-hackathon/list-of-project-titles\">here</a> <span style=\"color:#000000;\">to select any one solved Case Study on OpenFOAM&nbsp;</span></span></span></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><i>Note: Select a Case Study that would match your area of interest/ expertise. The Case Study(ies) that you will select needs to be solved by 20th Jan 2024.&nbsp;You may make&nbsp;multiple submissions within this mentioned date.&nbsp;&nbsp;</i></span></span></span></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Step 2: Submit the case files of the upgraded&nbsp;Case Study along a report.**</span></span></span></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><i>Note: You may release a Case Study before the period that is stipulated for the problem and take up another one that matches your expertise.&nbsp;</i></span></span></span></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Step 3: After you submit the case files and report, you&nbsp;will be requested&nbsp;to take up at least 2 case studies submitted by other participants for review.&nbsp;</span></span></span></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Submission Guidelines</span></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\">\r\n<ol style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11px;\">\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">Log in to the</span>&nbsp;<a data-mce-href=\"https://cfd.fossee.in\" href=\"https://cfd.fossee.in/\" target=\"_blank\">CFD website</a>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#000000;\">and submit a proposal</span>&nbsp;<a data-mce-href=\"https://cfd.fossee.in/cfd-hackathon/proposal\" href=\"https://cfd.fossee.in/cfd-hackathon/proposal\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Click on the My Submissions tab on the left-hand side menu to upload your case files.&nbsp;</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">In case we do not receive your submission by the end of the completion date, the submission will be released back to the repository.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">To submit more&nbsp;problems, mark the current one completed and propose a new problem using the same proposal form.</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">Submission Checklist:</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">A zip file consisting of the Case files updated to the latest version selected while submitting the proposal.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">A&nbsp;report that contains the post-processing results of the case study. The results&nbsp;should be matching with the one that is already there in the previous version.&nbsp;</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">The report should be ideally a one page document containing the post processing results like contours, plots etc. **</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</div>\r\n',	'',	'full_html'),
('page',	0,	301,	301,	'und',	0,	'<head>\r\n<script src=\"https://discuss.fossee.in/javascripts/embed-topics.js\"></script>\r\n<style>\r\n      d-topics-list iframe{\r\n        width: 100%!important;\r\n        }\r\n    </style>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n    <d-topics-list discourse-url=\"https://discuss.fossee.in\" category=\"39\" per-page=\"5\" allow-create=\"true\"></d-topics-list>\r\n</body>',	'',	'php_code'),
('list_of_faculty_partners',	0,	302,	302,	'und',	0,	'<p>Dr. Abhishek Dutta</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Designation</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Associate Professor</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Department of Chemical Engineering</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Institution</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Izmir Institute of Technology, Turkey</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Institute Profile:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://che.iyte.edu.tr/en/faculty-members/\">https://che.iyte.edu.tr/en/faculty-members/</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>LinkedIn Profile:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/abhishekdutta77/\">https://www.linkedin.com/in/abhishekdutta77/</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Areas of Interest:&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 14.6667px;\">Gas-Solid Multiphase Flows Population Balance Modeling Conjugate Heat Transfer</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Contribution</strong>: Conducted a session on \'Conjugate Heat Transfer in an enclosed system\' during the Online workshop namely&nbsp;\'Tackling CFD &amp; Heat Transfer Problems using OpenFOAM\', organised by FOSSEE, IIT Bombay, during 19-24 Feb 2024.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Internships Guided</strong></p>\r\n<p>1) Name: Arun KL<strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p>Institution: Anna University</p>\r\n<p>Link to the Case Study Project:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://cfd.fossee.in/case-study-project/case-study-run/280\">here</a></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n',	'',	'full_html'),
('news_and_events',	0,	303,	303,	'und',	0,	'<p>The OpenFOAM team of FOSSEE, IIT Bombay, offered a 6-Day Workshop on \'Tackling Computational Fluid Dynamics and Heat Transfer Problems using OpenFOAM\'. The workshop comprised of theory and demonstation&nbsp;sessions. Participants found it extremely useful for their academics and career.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Recording of this Workshop is available <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=58Suc174ICQ&amp;list=PL_uaeekrhGzINJInNWIxW53G82BJRAkvR\">here</a>.&nbsp;</p>\r\n',	'',	'full_html'),
('news_and_events',	0,	305,	305,	'und',	0,	'<div style=\"border: 0px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; margin: 0px; outline: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252); color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin: 0px; outline: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-family: inherit; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin: 0px; outline: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-family: inherit; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin: 0px; outline: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-family: inherit; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin: 0px; outline: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: justify;\">The OpenFOAM Hackathon was&nbsp;a platform for the CFD-OpenFOAM community to show their skills in OpenFOAM. Participants&nbsp;upgraded solved Case Studies available under the \'Completed Case Studies\' under the Case Study Project of OpenFOAM&nbsp;into the latest versions of OpenFOAM&nbsp; (v10 and v2212) according to the standards of</span></span><span style=\"border: 0px; font-family: inherit; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin: 0px; outline: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</span><a data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://openfoam.org/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1699686804826000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3nzV8aRaLmKjafToygFmDc\" href=\"https://openfoam.org/\" style=\"border: 0px; font-family: Open-sans; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin: 0px; outline: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(0, 123, 255); text-decoration-line: none; box-sizing: border-box; text-align: justify;\" target=\"_blank\">openfoam.org</a><span style=\"border: 0px; font-family: inherit; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin: 0px; outline: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"border: 0px; font-family: inherit; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin: 0px; outline: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-family: inherit; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin: 0px; outline: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: justify;\">or</span></span><span style=\"border: 0px; font-family: inherit; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin: 0px; outline: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</span><a data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.openfoam.com/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1699686804827000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2f263RkTqpCh6XF_J6VwDo\" href=\"https://www.openfoam.com/\" style=\"border: 0px; font-family: Open-sans; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin: 0px; outline: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(0, 123, 255); text-decoration-line: none; box-sizing: border-box; text-align: justify;\" target=\"_blank\">openfoam.<wbr />com</a><span style=\"border: 0px; font-family: inherit; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin: 0px; outline: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); text-align: justify;\">. Participants</span></span></span><span style=\"border: 0px; font-family: inherit; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin: 0px; outline: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin: 0px; outline: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">&nbsp;could pick&nbsp;up any&nbsp;case study and&nbsp;upgrade it to the latest version of OpenFOAM (v10 and v2212).</span></span></span></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"border: 0px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; margin: 0px; outline: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252); color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"border: 0px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; margin: 0px; outline: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252); color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">The list of Case Studies upgraded to the latest versions of OpenFOAM, as a part of this Hackathon is listed <a href=\"https://cfd.fossee.in/cfd-hackathon/completed-case-studies\">here</a>.&nbsp;</span></div>\r\n',	'',	'full_html'),
('list_of_faculty_partners',	0,	306,	306,	'und',	0,	'<h4><strong>Designation:</strong></h4>\r\n\r\n<p>Assistant Professor</p>\r\n\r\n<h4><strong>Institution:</strong></h4>\r\n\r\n<p>Shiv Nadar University</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span data-mce-style=\"font-size: small; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #555555;\">Department of Chemical Engineering</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span data-mce-style=\"color: #555555; font-size: small; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">School of Engineering (SoE)</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span data-mce-style=\"color: #555555; font-size: small; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>Areas of interest:</strong>&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 14.6667px;\">CFD, Reaction/ polymerization, microfluidics</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span data-mce-style=\"color: #555555;\"><span data-mce-style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span data-mce-style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Contribution:</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li><span data-mce-style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span data-mce-style=\"font-size: small;\"><span data-mce-style=\"color: #555555;\">Conducted a session on \'Introduction to advanced meshing\', during the online workshop on the Basics of CFD &amp; OpenFOAM, organized by the FOSSEE Project, IIT Bombay, in 2023</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span>Conducted a session on \'Chemical reaction, tracer gas\' during the workshop held on \'Tackling Computational Fluid Dynamics and Heat Transfer Problems on CFD\' held in Feb 2024 by the FOSSEE Project, IIT Bombay, in 2024</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p><span data-mce-style=\"color: #555555;\"><span data-mce-style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span data-mce-style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Students Guided:</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>1) Name: Harish Jayaraj</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp; Institute: National Institute of Technology, Rourkela</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp; Case Study Link: <a href=\"https://cfd.fossee.in/case-study-project/case-study-run/245\">Here</a></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>2) Name: <span><span>Atharva Dhore</span></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Institute: Vishwakarma Institute Of Information Technology - Pune</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Research Migration Project Link: <a href=\"https://cfd.fossee.in/research-migration-project/research-migration-run/50\">Here</a></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>3) Name: Shakti Prasad Patra</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Institute: National Institute of Technology, Rourkela</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Case Study Link: <a href=\"https://cfd.fossee.in/case-study-project/case-study-run/295\">Here</a><br /><br /></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>',	'',	'full_html'),
('list_of_faculty_partners',	0,	308,	308,	'und',	0,	'<p><strong>Designation</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Assistant Professor</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Institute</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Shiv Nadar University</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Profile: Available <a href=\"https://snu.edu.in/faculty/sathi-rajesh-reddy/\">here</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Areas of interest:&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 14.6667px;\">Interface Tracking Multiphase flows, Gas Turbine Film Cooling, Cavitation</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Student&nbsp;Guided</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Veasna Mom</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Instititute: Gujarat Power Engineering and Research Institute</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Research Migration Project available <a href=\"https://cfd.fossee.in/research-migration-project/research-migration-run/51\">here</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n',	'',	'full_html'),
('page',	0,	309,	309,	'und',	0,	'<p><br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" height=\"215\" src=\"https://cfd.fossee.in/sites/default/files/Chandan_B_0.jpeg\" width=\"160\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Prof. Chandan Bose</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Assistant Professor</p>\r\n\r\n<p>University of Birmingham</p>\r\n\r\n<p>University Profile: <a href=\"https://research.birmingham.ac.uk/en/persons/chandan-bose\">Here</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>LinkedIn Profile: <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/cbose1991/\">Here</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Students guided:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>1. Mena G Pillai, IIT Madras (2022)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Link to the Research Migration Project: <a href=\"https://cfd.fossee.in/research-migration-project/research-migration-run/28\">Here</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>2. Akshay Shimpi, IIT Madras (2023)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Link to the the Research Migration Project: <a href=\"https://cfd.fossee.in/research-migration-project/research-migration-run/42\">Here</a>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>3. Sambhav Sahani, Tribhuvan University (2023)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Link to Case Study Project: <a href=\"https://cfd.fossee.in/case-study-project/case-study-run/242\">Here</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>4. Yukesh Karki, Tribhuvan University (2024)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Link to Case Study Project: <a href=\"https://cfd.fossee.in/case-study-project/case-study-run/270\">Here</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>5. Saad Khan, Instutite of Aeronautical Engineering (JNU)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>6. Lucky Jayswal, Tribhuvan University</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Link to Case Study Project: <a href=\"https://cfd.fossee.in/case-study-project/case-study-run/273\">Here</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>7. Antim Gupta, Oxford Brooke\'s University</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Link to Research Migration Project: <a href=\"https://cfd.fossee.in/research-migration-project/research-migration-run/54\">Here</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>8. Jonathan Thomas John, IIT (ISM) Dhanbad</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Link to Case Study Project: <a href=\"https://cfd.fossee.in/case-study-project/case-study-run/269\">Here</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>9. Prabin Paudel, Tribhuvan University</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Link to Case Study Project: <a href=\"https://cfd.fossee.in/case-study-project/case-study-run/274\">Here</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>10. Manjil Sitoula, Tribhuvan University</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Link to Case Study Project: <a href=\"https://cfd.fossee.in/case-study-project/case-study-run/272\">Here</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>11. Sugam Lamsal</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Link to Research Migration Project: <a href=\"https://cfd.fossee.in/research-migration-project/research-migration-run/67\">Here</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>12. Toran Bahadur Niroula</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Link to Research Migration Project: <a href=\"https://cfd.fossee.in/research-migration-project/research-migration-run/62\">Here</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>13. Syed Aaqib Ahmed</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Link to Research Migration Project: <a href=\"https://cfd.fossee.in/case-study-project/case-study-run/293\">Here</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>14) Name:<strong> </strong>Syed Aaqib Ahmed<br />\r\nLink to the Case Study Project<strong>:&nbsp;</strong><a data-mce-href=\"https://cfd.fossee.in/case-study-project/case-study-run/293\" href=\"https://cfd.fossee.in/case-study-project/case-study-run/293\">here</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Sessions Delivered in Workshops organised by FOSSEE, IIT Bombay</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>1. Dynamic Meshing Strategies in OpenFOAM, as a part of the Workshop on the \'Basics of CFD and OpenFOAM\', held in Jan&nbsp;2023</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Link to the Workshop Session: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SsBwKbqZUF4&amp;list=PL_uaeekrhGzIrA5mPP-IAQCf1NR03NqBm&amp;index=9\">Here</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>2. External Aerodynamics and Dynamic Meshing Strategies in OpenFOAM, as a part of the Workshop \'Tackling Computational Fluid Dynamics &amp; Heat Transfer Problems using OpenFOAM\', held in Feb&nbsp;2024</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Link to the Workshop Session: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IkvpgeaNlJk&amp;list=PL_uaeekrhGzINJInNWIxW53G82BJRAkvR&amp;index=8\">Here</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n',	'',	'full_html'),
('news_and_events',	0,	310,	310,	'und',	0,	'<p>FOSSEE, IIT Bombay, organizes the first Industry-Academia Interaction to foster the Research &amp; Development and Learning of Computation Fluid Dynamics (CFD) using OpenFOAM. This is&nbsp;an endeavour to synergize the ongoing developments in the field of CFD in academics as well as in the corporate sector. This interaction will help FOSSEE to train the CFD enthusiasts to increase their job potential. It will also help the corporate section to augment their R&amp;D effort and access to well-trained potential employees. The Academia will also be benefitted by connecting their research to the problems that the CFD industry is focusing on at present.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Program Details:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Date: 29th Nov 2024</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Time: 10:00 a.m&nbsp;to 5:00 p.m</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Mode: Hybrid (IIT Bombay and Online)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Link to join the program will be shared to interested candidates. For more details please write to us at contact-cfd@fossee.in.</p>\r\n',	'',	'full_html'),
('news_and_events',	0,	311,	311,	'und',	0,	'<p><span style=\"color:#0000CD;\">FOSSEE, IIT Bombay, organizes the first Industry-Academia Interaction to foster the Research &amp; Development and Learning of Computation Fluid Dynamics (CFD) using OpenFOAM. This is&nbsp;is an endeavour to synergize the ongoing developments in the field of CFD in academics as well as in the corporate sector. This interaction will help FOSSEE to train the CFD enthusiasts to increase their job potential. It will also help the corporate section to augment their R&amp;D effort and access to well-trained potential employees. The Academia will also be benefitted by connecting their research to the problems that the CFD industry is focusing on at present.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000CD;\"><strong>Program Details</strong></span>:</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000CD;\"><strong>Date</strong>: 29th Nov 2024</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000CD;\"><strong>Time</strong>: 10:00 a.m to 5:00 p.m</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000CD;\"><strong>Mode</strong>: Hybrid (IIT Bombay and Online)</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000CD;\"><strong>Link to join the program will be priovided to interested candidates.</strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000CD;\">Please write to us at contact-cfd@fossee.in for more details.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n',	'',	'full_html'),
('page',	0,	312,	312,	'und',	0,	'<p><iframe allowfullscreen=\"true\" frameborder=\"0\" height=\"569\" mozallowfullscreen=\"true\" scrolling=\"no\" src=\"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/e/2PACX-1vQXmXdgHtXztpDEPFvbVwPSOmE36nTbPC9ILesOaYegSEj-JcpoyAnHq9d-H72PNH1IEnUqsA64C6a7/embed?start=false&amp;loop=false&amp;delayms=3000\" webkitallowfullscreen=\"true\" width=\"750\"></iframe></p>\r\n',	'',	'full_html'),
('page',	0,	313,	313,	'und',	0,	'<p>The Advisory Board of the CFD-OpenFOAM team of FOSSEE, IIT Bombay, is composed of eminent Professionals from the CFD Industry. All the Advisory Board Members of the CFD-OpenFOAM team are passionate about fostering the Research &amp; Development of CFD. The learners of OpenFOAM, FOSSEE, will get directions from the Advisory Board Members on the areas that are in current demand in the CFD industry. The learners associated with OpenFOAM, FOSSEE, will be able to increase their recruitment potential with the guidance from the Advisory Board of CFD-OpenFOAM, FOSSEE, IIT Bombay.</p><h4>List of Advisory Board Members of CFD-OpenFOAM, FOSSEE, IIT Bombay</h4><p><u>[view:list_of_partners=block_advisory_board]</u></p><!--?php\r\nprint views_embed_view(\'list_of_partners\', \'block_advisory_board\');\r\n?--><img src=\"https://cfd.fossee.in/sites/default/files/btm-logo-03.png\" alt=\"BTM Logos\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\"><style>\r\ntable{width:100%;}\r\ntable td{width:2000px;}\r\n</style>',	'',	'full_html'),
('list_of_faculty_partners',	0,	314,	314,	'und',	0,	'<p><strong>Dr. Vivek Vitankar</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Founder Director at FluiDimensions</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Dr. Vitankar is a visiting Faculty ICT Mumbai, Visiting Faculty ICT-IOC Bhubaneshwar, Visiting Faculty NIT Meghalaya</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Post Doctoral Research, Iowa State University, Ames, Iowa, USA</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Ph.D, Chemical Engineering, UICT, Mumbai University</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Guided 25 Master and Ph.D students across India</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">42 publications in National &amp; International journals</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Expertise:</strong> CFD Multiphase Flows, Combustion Modeling, Reactive Flow Systems, Energy Systems, Process Design - patented carbon black reactor (US 20130039840), Data Integration, Software Customization, Mixing &amp; Heat Transfer, Rheology &amp; Kinetics, Innovative Equipment Design.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>LinkedIn Profile</strong>- <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/vivek-vitankar-2403b810/\">Click Here</a></p>\r\n',	'',	'full_html'),
('list_of_faculty_partners',	0,	315,	315,	'und',	0,	'<p><strong>Dr. Manabendra M De</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Principal Scientist, Systems Engineering Division, CSIR-NAL and&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Asst. Professor, Academy of Scientific and<strong>&nbsp;</strong>Innovative&nbsp;Research</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Dr. De holds B.E.&nbsp; Mechanical Engineering from South Gujarat University,&nbsp; M.Tech with specialization in Turbomachines from SVNIT, Surat,, PG Diploma in Intellectual Property Rights from IGNOU &amp; WIPO, and PhD degree in Applied Mechanics – Computational Fluid Dynamics from IIT Madras.</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">He joined CSIR-NAL, Bengaluru in 2006 as Junior Scientist in Wind Energy Division. At present, he is serving as Principal Scientist in Systems Engineering Division. Holds an Honorary Asst. Professorship in Academy of Scientific and Innovative Research (AcSIR), New Delhi.</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">His research areas include applied CFD, System engineering, wind Turbines Rotor Aerodynamics, AS9100 Certification and Intellectual Property Rights.</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Highlights:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li aria-level=\"1\" dir=\"ltr\">\r\n	<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Serves as a subject expert in International and National committees.</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li aria-level=\"1\" dir=\"ltr\">\r\n	<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Has over 30 research publications in national and international SCI journals and conferences</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li aria-level=\"1\" dir=\"ltr\">\r\n	<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Granted 2 Indian patents in the field of Renewable Energy (Wind turbines) and Flapping wing aerial platform.</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li aria-level=\"1\" dir=\"ltr\">\r\n	<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Involved in guiding students for their final year project works, internships and serves as thesis examiner for PhD and M.Tech students.</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Interns Guided:</strong></p>\r\n<p>Name: Manu Aryal</p>\r\n<p>Institute: Tribhuvan University, Nepal</p>\r\n<p>Year: 2025</p>\r\n<p>Link to the internship project: <a href=\"https://cfd.fossee.in/case-study-project/case-study-run/298\">here</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">LinkedIn&nbsp;Profile-<a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/manabendra-de-a8a74a118/\">&nbsp;Click Here</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n',	'',	'full_html'),
('list_of_faculty_partners',	0,	316,	316,	'und',	0,	'<p><strong>Mr. Pushkar Sheth</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Engineering Technical Leader – Wabtec Corporation</strong><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Mr. Sheth holds Master’s in Automotive Engineering from Coventry University</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Over 16 years of experience in Computer-Aided Engineering,&nbsp; Diesel engine component durability simulation using FEA, multibody dynamics, and CFD, High cycle and low cycle fatigue methodologies, utilizing both commercial and bespoke in-house codes</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Authored internal best practice documents for end-to-end durability processes for critical diesel engine components and combustion simulation.</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Significant contributions to the field through patents on heat exchanger durability and publications on combustion methodology. Additionally, he has</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Authored a book titled \"Build Engineering Applications using Python and Flask\" and maintains a small open-source Python library for 3D-FFT called Siglyser.</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>LinkedIn Profile</strong>- <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/psheth/\">Click Here</a></p>\r\n\r\n<br />\r\n<p><strong>Intern Guided</strong></p>\r\n<p>Name: Shakti Prasad Patra</p>\r\n<p>Institute: National Institute of Technology, Rourkela</p>\r\n<p>Case Study Link: <a href=\"https://cfd.fossee.in/case-study-project/case-study-run/295\">Here</a></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n',	'',	'full_html'),
('list_of_faculty_partners',	0,	317,	317,	'und',	0,	'<p><strong>Dr. Joseph Prabhu</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>CFD Engineer at Indian Register of Shipping (IR Class)</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Dr. Joseph Prabhu is a CFD engineer with a Ph.D. from IIT Kharagpur specializing in Marine Structures CFD.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Currently, he is associated with the Research division of Indian Register of Shipping.</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">With over a decade of experience, Dr. Joseph Prabhu has a deep understanding of marine hydrodynamics. His research has led to the development of numerical solvers, including a potential-based solver for manoeuvering dynamics. This work has been recognized through publications in peer-reviewed journals and presentations at international conferences.</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Dr. Joseph Prabhu is proficient in both commercial and open-source CFD software. He has extensive experience in solving a wide range of marine hydrodynamics problems using openFOAM, like resistance and open water characteristics of propeller.</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>LinkedIn Profile-</strong> <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/dr-joseph-prabhu-689b2168/\">Click Here</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n',	'',	'full_html'),
('list_of_faculty_partners',	0,	318,	318,	'und',	0,	'<p><strong>Dr. Abhishek Dutta</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Founder of the Tech Startup Simuligence</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Dr. Dutta has a PhD in Chemical Engineering from Ghent University, Belgium. After teaching in KU Leuven Belgium for a few years, he is currently an Associate Professor at the Department of Chemical Engineering, Izmir Institute of Technology, where he is the Team Leader of Industrial Flow &amp; Process Modeling Group (iFPMg).</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">His research focuses on Energy-efficiency for the improvement of existing and development of new processes, &nbsp;resource-efficiency involving complex hydrodynamic, cost-efficiency valorizing waste resource recovery towards carbon footprint reduction</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Dr. Dutta is also the Co-chair of Computational Science &amp; Engineering Department at Izmir Institute of Technology and is leading industry-oriented research with a focus on digitization for Turkish companies and SMEs in developing digital twins.</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">He brings over 15 years of expertise in numerical modeling, simulation, and prototype development, with a strong track record in the validation of engineering processes to Simuligence. The company was established in July 2021, Vilnius (Lithuania) with a focus on three key domains: Environmental Technology, Health Technology, and Energy Technology.</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>LinkedIn</strong>- <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/abhishekdutta77/\">Click Here</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n',	'',	'full_html'),
('list_of_faculty_partners',	0,	319,	319,	'und',	0,	'<p><strong>Mr. Nikhil Bhamare</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Founder of the Tech Startup CFD Baba</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Mr. Bhamare has a Bachelors in Mechanical Engineering and Masters in Thermal Engineering. He was introduced to CFD during his Masters.</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp;He had to spend a lot of time gathering the information that is spread across various sources to perform successful CFD analyses. He now wishes to help beginners in starting their CFD journey smoothly.</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">He has invested more than 4000 hours working with OpenFOAM and more than 6000 hours working with Ansys Fluent in the CFD industry.</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">He has solved various academic and industrial problems from all over the globe related to internal flows / external aerodynamics, heat transfer, porous medium, species transport and multiphase flows. I have also trained more than 4000 students worldwide with CFD courses related to OpenFOAM and Ansys Fluent.</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">He wishes to spread as much CFD application knowledge as possible, to help new CFD enthusiasts with starting their career.</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">He has guided a Semester Long Intern of FOSSEE, Mr. Toran Bahadur Niroula. Internship work details are available  </p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">LinkedIn Profile- <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/nikhil-bhamare-165280186/\">Click Here</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Interns Guided</strong></p>\r\n<p>Name: Toran Bahadur Niroula</p>\r\n<p>Institute: Tribhuvan University,</p>\r\n<p>Research Migration Project available <a href=\"https://cfd.fossee.in/research-migration-project/research-migration-run/62\">here</a></p>\r\n',	'',	'full_html'),
('list_of_faculty_partners',	0,	320,	320,	'und',	0,	'<p><strong>Mr. Manish Bhasme</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Director at Fluent Engineering Solutions &amp; CFD Consultants India</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Mr. Bhasme is an experienced computational fluid dynamics (CFD) professional with expertise in solving complex engineering challenges across industries such as HVAC, water treatment, energy, and more.</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp;As the Technical Director at CFD Consultants India, he has led numerous high-profile CFD projects, delivering innovative solutions to improve system efficiency and safety. An alumnus of NITK Surathkal, he is dedicated to advancing computational modeling techniques and fostering collaborations that drive engineering excellence.</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>LinkedIn Profile</strong>- <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/manish-bhasme-fluent-es/\">Click Here</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n',	'',	'full_html'),
('list_of_faculty_partners',	0,	321,	321,	'und',	0,	'<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Mr. Arnab Chakraborty</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Researcher at TCS Research and Innovation (TCS Innovation Lab)</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Mr. Chakraborty has a B.Eng in Power Engineering from Jadavpur University, followed by an M.Tech in Ocean Engineering and Naval Architecture from IIT Kharagpur, and an M.S. (by Research) in Mechanical Engineering (Thermal) from IIT Madras.</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">He has previously been a S.N. Bose scholar at Texas A&amp;M University (2017) and a VSRP fellow at the Clean Combustion Research Group at KAUST, Saudi Arabia (2021). He has received internship awards from the Indian Academy of Science (IAS) at IISc, IIT Madras, and IIT Gandhinagar. In 2022, he was honored with the Indian National Academy of Engineering (INAE) Innovative Project Award by the Department of Science and Technology (DST), Government of India, a prestigious accolade given to only eight individuals nationwide and the sole recipient from IIT Madras and West Bengal.</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp;Additionally, Mr. Chakraborty has worked as a simulation engineer at Emerson Process Management, a Fortune 500 company, and as a fluid mechanics consultant at AnalyticsPlus Inc. He has authored seven journal articles, 30 conference papers, and five book chapters. Arnab also serves as a reviewer for esteemed journals such as Physics of Fluids, Atomization and Sprays, and IMechE: Part A, C, and M, as well as for conferences including FMFP, ASME Gas Turbine India (GT India), and ASME</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>LinkedIn Profile</strong>- <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/arnab-chakraborty-5b148958/\">Click Here</a></p>\r\n\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n',	'',	'full_html'),
('list_of_faculty_partners',	0,	322,	322,	'und',	0,	'<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Mr. Sourabh Mukhopadhyay&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Lead HTFD/SCS Analyst, Ag engineering Virtual Design &amp; Verification&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>John Deere India Pvt. Ltd.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Mr. Mukhopadhyay is an accomplished researcher currently pursuing his PhD at IIT Kharagpur, where he also completed his Masters degree in 2016. With over 8.5 years of experience in agricultural product development, he has developed a strong expertise in areas such as Computational Fluid Dynamics (CFD), Discrete Element Method (DEM), Machine Learning (ML), and Fluid Structure Interaction (FSI). His extensive research background includes significant work on multiphase and granular flow, which has resulted in the filing of 7 patents related to agricultural product development and the publication of 5 papers in highly regarded international journals.</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">His PhD research focuses on developing a contact model to evaluate energy dissipation in bulk granular flow, further enhancing his contributions to the field. He has a keen interest in back-end code development and deployment for CFD and DEM applications, showcasing his technical proficiency and dedication to advancing technology. His combination of practical experience, patents, and publications positions him as an asset in the agricultural sector, where he aims to drive innovation and improve product development processes. Mr. Mukhopadhyay’s commitment to research and development makes him a promising technical leader in agricultural engineering and technology.</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>LinkedIn Profile</strong>- <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/sourabh-mukhopadhyay-64075494/\">Click Here</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n',	'',	'full_html'),
('list_of_faculty_partners',	0,	323,	323,	'und',	0,	'<p dir=\"ltr\">Mr. Adwaith Gupta&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Founder &amp; CEO&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Paanduv Applications Pvt. Ltd.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Mr. Gupta has a B.Tech from NIT Warangal and MS from Stanford University.</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">He&nbsp; is an accomplished engineering professional with extensive experience in advancing Computational Fluid Dynamics (CFD) across various industries and academic sectors. He is the lead developer of the world’s first all-inclusive computational physics-based software for additive manufacturing called AM PravaH ® by Paanduv ®. The software is particularly adding immense value to national defense systems.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">For his work, he has received multiple accolades such as Indian Institute of Metals award for innovation in Materials technology, best indigenous software developer of the year awards by IITB and IID, best deep tech start award by Hon. Smt Anandi Ben Patel. Before founding Paanduv Applications, Adwaith served as a Senior CFD Engineer and AI Engineer in the U.S., where he expanded CFD use across emerging sectors, developed specialized solvers, and led global academic programs. As Global Head of academic programs, he played a key role in integrating CFD into research and industry worldwide.</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Mr. Gupta&nbsp; is an active thought leader, sharing insights through his blog and exploring the integration of OpenFOAM into an academic curriculum. To materialize his thoughts, Adwaith launched the Paanduv Applications Advanced Academic Program aka PA3P in 2020 and International Simulation Olympiad in 2022.</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>LinkedIn Profile</strong>- <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/adwaith-gupta/\">Click Here</a></p>\r\n\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n',	'',	'full_html'),
('list_of_faculty_partners',	0,	324,	324,	'und',	0,	'<p><strong>Dr. V. Ashok</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Former Associate&nbsp;Director, VSSC, ISRO</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Dr. V.Ashok did his BTech Mechanical Engineering from College of Engineering Thiruvananthapuram in 1987 and MTech in Aerospace&nbsp;engineering from IIT Kanpur in 1989. He joined Aerodynamics division of&nbsp;Vikram Sarabhai Space Centre in 1989 and has been working for the past&nbsp;three and half decades in the areas of aerodynamics, CFD code&nbsp;development and applications and chemically reacting flows.&nbsp;He obtained Doctorate from Indian Institute of Space Science and Technology in the year 2013.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>He served as Group Director of Aerodynamics and Aerothermal group from 2012 to 2017 and as Deputy Director of Aeronautics Entity from 2017 to 2023 and Associate Director of Vikram Sarabhai Space Centre from 2023 to 2024. His main contributions are in the area of CFD code development PARAS3D which is a Parallelised Cartesian mesh based code and is a workhorse for various flow problems in VSSC and other aerodynamic labs in the country.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>He has also mentored the indigenous PRAVAHA unstructured body fitted mesh based solver which can run on both CPU and GPU cluster is also another important alternative to commercial CFD codes.&nbsp;He represented ISRO in the steering group of Inter Agency Space Debris Coordination committee from 2012 to 2017. He has made significant contributions to the successful missions of LVM3- Chandrayaan 3, Reusable Launch Vehicle technology demonstrator missions, Scramjet technology demonstrator missions , PSLV Aditya L1 mission , Test vehicle development projects, upcoming Gaganyaan missions and many others.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n',	'',	'full_html'),
('list_of_faculty_partners',	0,	325,	325,	'und',	0,	'<p><strong>Designation</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Assistant Professor</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Institute</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>MIT Art, Design and Technology University</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>LinkedIn Profile:&nbsp;</strong>Available&nbsp;<a href=\"http://https://www.linkedin.com/in/tushar-chourushi-b654011b4/\">here</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Areas of interest:</strong>&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\">CFD, Numerical methods, Rarefied Gas Dynamics, Non-Newtonian fluid and Multiphase flows</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Students Guided</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>1) Ishar Singh Saini</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Institute: Amity University, Mumbai</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Case Study Project available&nbsp;<a href=\"https://cfd.fossee.in/case-study-project/case-study-run/236\">here</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>2) Evan Fernandes</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Institute: Amity University, Mumbai</p>\r\n\r\n<p>3) Eshant Shinde</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Institute: Amity University, Mumbai&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Case Study Project available <a href=\"https://cfd.fossee.in/case-study-project/case-study-run/281\">here</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>4) Toran Bahadur Niroula<br /><br /></p>\r\n<p>Institute: Tribhuvan University, Nepal</p>\r\n<p>Case Study Project available&nbsp;here</p>',	'',	'full_html'),
('list_of_faculty_partners',	0,	326,	326,	'und',	0,	'<p style=\"border: 0px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; margin: 0px 0px 0.5em; outline: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 2em; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252);\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><strong>Designation:</strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"border: 0px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; margin: 0px 0px 0.5em; outline: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 2em; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252);\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Assistant Professor</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"border: 0px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; margin: 0px 0px 0.5em; outline: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 2em; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252);\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><strong>Institute:</strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"border: 0px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; margin: 0px 0px 0.5em; outline: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 2em; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252);\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Division of Mechanical Engineering</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"border: 0px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; margin: 0px 0px 0.5em; outline: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 2em; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252);\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">School of Engineering</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"border: 0px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; margin: 0px 0px 0.5em; outline: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 2em; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252);\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Cochin University of Science and Technology</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"border: 0px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; margin: 0px 0px 0.5em; outline: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 2em; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252);\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><strong>LinkedIn Profile:</strong>&nbsp;</span></span><a data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.linkedin.com/in/dr-harikrishnan-s-276a0b81/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1678164409355000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0hAkhpGK8ZBqRTK36pIKbC\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/dr-harikrishnan-s-276a0b81/\" style=\"color: rgb(17, 85, 204); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.linkedin.<wbr />com/in/dr-harikrishnan-s-<wbr />276a0b81/</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"border: 0px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; margin: 0px 0px 0.5em; outline: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 2em; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252);\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><strong>Areas of interest:</strong>&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">Heat Transfer, Multiphase flows and Air-conditioning&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"border: 0px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; margin: 0px 0px 0.5em; outline: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 2em; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252);\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><strong>Contribution:&nbsp;</strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"border: 0px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; margin: 0px 0px 0.5em; outline: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 2em; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252);\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Lecture on \'Introduction to Meshing\' during the Online Workshop on the Basics of CFD &amp; OpenFOAM, organized by the FOSSEE project, IIT Bombay, during 11-13 Jan 2023.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"border: 0px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; margin: 0px 0px 0.5em; outline: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 2em; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252);\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Students Guided:</span></span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"border: 0px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; margin: 0px 0px 0.5em; outline: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 2em; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252);\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">1) Aditya TR,&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); background-color: rgb(253, 253, 253);\">Amrita Vishwa VIdyapeetam</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"border: 0px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; margin: 0px 0px 0.5em; outline: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 2em; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252);\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); background-color: rgb(253, 253, 253);\">Link to the Case Study Project <a href=\"https://cfd.fossee.in/case-study-project/case-study-run/279\">here</a></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"border: 0px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; margin: 0px 0px 0.5em; outline: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 2em; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252);\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">2)&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); background-color: rgb(253, 253, 253);\">Mohamed Adnan Kulam Najmudeen, Industry Professional</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"border: 0px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; margin: 0px 0px 0.5em; outline: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 2em; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252);\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); background-color: rgb(253, 253, 253);\">Link to Case Study Project <a href=\"https://cfd.fossee.in/case-study-project/case-study-run/278\">here</a>&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n',	'',	'full_html'),
('list_of_faculty_partners',	0,	327,	327,	'und',	0,	'<p>CFD Engineer @ Ecozen Solutions PVT. LTD.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Divyesh holds a Bachelor of Engineering in Mechanical Engineering from Gujarat Technological University. He participated in the FOSSEE internship program and later served as a project research assistant at FOSSEE.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>He has a background in solar manufacturing processes, including the design and simulation of stages such as MG-Silicon production, PolySilicon processing, ingot and wafer manufacturing, cell manufacturing, and module manufacturing.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Currently, Divyesh is a Thermal Design Analysis Engineer at Ecozen, where he contributes to the company\'s vision of developing cold value chain products in India powered by renewable energy.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>His areas of expertise include heat transfer, multiphase flow, species transport, and internal and external fluid flows.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Internships Guided</strong></p>\r\n<p>1) Name: Rohin Kappillil Rajeev<strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p>Link to the Case Study Project:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://cfd.fossee.in/case-study-project/case-study-run/292\">here</a></p>\r\n<p>2) Name: Syed Aaqib Ahmed<br />Link to the Case Study Project<strong>:&nbsp;</strong><a href=\"https://cfd.fossee.in/case-study-project/case-study-run/293\">here</a></p>\r\n',	'',	'full_html'),
('list_of_faculty_partners',	0,	328,	328,	'und',	0,	'<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-12333bff-7fff-7f69-8881-d1e0dffdb9d3\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Dr. Sooraj Padinjattayil is the CEO and co-founder of Experiqs Pvt. Ltd., an innovative R&amp;D platform that leverages interdisciplinary expertise to drive advanced research through cutting-edge computational modelling and experimental methodologies. He earned his Ph.D. in Mechanical Engineering from the Indian Institute of Technology Bombay (2013–2019) under the guidance of Prof. Amit Agrawal. His doctoral research explored bio-inspired hydrodynamics, focusing on geometric shape and surface modifications for drag reduction in low Reynolds number flows.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-12333bff-7fff-7f69-8881-d1e0dffdb9d3\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Dr. Padinjattayil further refined his expertise during a post-doctoral fellowship at the Laboratoire de Mécanique des Fluides de Lille (LMFL), France, where he collaborated with Prof. Jean-Marc Foucaut on turbulence and flow dynamics.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-12333bff-7fff-7f69-8881-d1e0dffdb9d3\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Dr. Padinjattayil combines academic rigor with entrepreneurial vision, consistently striving to bridge the gap between research and practical applications. His collaborative approach and commitment to innovation have enabled him to contribute meaningfully to advancements in fluid dynamics, computational modelling, and industrial R&amp;D.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-12333bff-7fff-7f69-8881-d1e0dffdb9d3\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">LinkedIn: https://www.linkedin.com/in/sooraj-padinjattayil-51854a35/</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-12333bff-7fff-7f69-8881-d1e0dffdb9d3\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Google Scholar: https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=0pf5F8oAAAAJ&amp;hl=en&amp;oi=ao</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n',	'',	'full_html'),
('list_of_faculty_partners',	0,	329,	329,	'und',	0,	'<p>Mr. Alok Nikhade</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Assistant Vice President of Technology<br />\r\nDepartment of Research and Development<br />\r\nEcofrost Technologies Pvt Ltd (Ecozen Solutions Pvt Ltd), Pune</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Mr. Alok embarked on his career as a Programming Instructor while pursuing his Master\'s in Hydro and Renewable Energy at IIT Roorkee in 2014. He simultaneously shared his expertise in mini-hydropower systems with postgraduate students at Lovely Professional University, Punjab, while teaching Foundation Engineering to undergraduates. Prior to joining Ecofrost Technologies in 2015, he gained valuable experience through internships in Bengaluru, focusing on computational fluid dynamics and heat transfer.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>At Ecofrost Technologies (an Ecozen company), Alok spearheaded the development of a solar micro cold storage utilizing vapor compression refrigeration and thermal energy storage. Working closely with a team of engineers and agricultural scientists, he successfully addressed on-farm challenges, resulting in a scalable and serviceable product with over 1200 units deployed across India, Southeast Asia, and Africa.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Currently, Alok leads the R&amp;D team at Ecozen, focusing on new product development and thermal engineering research to enhance post-harvest quality and cold chain packaging for perishable produce. He leverages both commercial and open-source solutions for FEA and CFD to address technical challenges.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Alok holds two technology patent applications, with one granted, for innovative cold thermal energy storage solutions integrated into new product development. He holds interests in heat exchangers, refrigeration technologies, electronic cooling and phase change materials.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n',	'',	'full_html'),
('page',	0,	330,	330,	'und',	0,	'<p class=\"rteright\"><span>Please keep visiting this page for updates</span><br />\r\n<span>Last updated on: 03 Nov 2025</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span><strong>The CFD team of FOSSEE, IIT Bombay is currently offering the Autumn Semester Long Internship 2025 for OpenFOAM. In Dec 2025 the team will commence the <span style=\"color:#c0392b;\">Winter Internship 2025 for OpenFOAM GUI Project</span>. Tentative period of this internship will be 45 days during Dec 2025-Jan 2026.</strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span><strong>Application for the Winter Fellowship will soon be open. Please keep checking&nbsp;<a href=\"https://fossee.in/fossee-internships\">https://fossee.in/fossee-internships</a></strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<p>Till the registration for the OpenFOAM GUI Winter Internship opens, you may check the sreening task as below-</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1tx4jcD1xBkUipa2XY6tifyAEohdAeWRR/view\">OpenFOAM GUI Screening Task</a></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"color:#008000;\"><strong>Benefits of Fellowship:</strong></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li>Mention in the URL of FOSSEE, IIT Bombay</li>\r\n	<li><span>Opportunity to work with OpenFOAM-CFD experts in FOSSEE, IIT Bombay</span></li>\r\n	<li><span>Certificate of FOSSEE Summer Fellowship</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"color:#008000;\"><strong>Resources to support the OpenFOAM GUI Internship:</strong></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#008000;\"><strong>Python:<a href=\"https://www.python.org/doc/\">Tutorial 1</a>, <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ix9cRaBkVe0\">Tutorial 2</a>, <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rfscVS0vtbw&amp;t=1s&amp;pp=ygUVcHl0aG9uIGZyZWUgY29kZSBjYW1w\">Tutorial 3</a></strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#008000;\"><strong>Blender Add-on Development: <a href=\"https://docs.blender.org/manual/en/latest/advanced/scripting/addon_tutorial.html\">Tutorial 1</a>, <a href=\"https://medium.com/@kent_edoloverio/create-your-first-blender-addon-4fa84944199c\">Tutorial 2</a>, <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MOjqYgfvxAk&amp;list=PLM7a67u-tCeDIOvsctNJgnOdZW_xl3QGo\">Tutorial 3</a>, <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Y67eCfiqJQU\">Tutorial 4</a></strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#008000;\"><strong>FreeCAD: <a href=\"https://wiki.freecad.org/Category:Tutorials\">Tutorial 1</a>, <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=t_yh_S31R9g&amp;list=PLWuyJLVUNtc3kYxQQiOriVJiTbQ0qNBXh\">Tutorial 2</a>, <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jULWgMV9_TM&amp;pp=ygUHZnJlZUNBRA%3D%3D\">Tutorial 3</a>, <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZPsLhvgU8kc&amp;pp=ygUHZnJlZUNBRA%3D%3D\">Tutorial 4</a></strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#008000;\"><strong>FreeCAD Add-on Development : <a href=\"https://freecad.github.io/DevelopersHandbook/\">Tutorial 1</a>, <a href=\"https://youtu.be/k87S7mTRUN8?si=_FmAScHzCGpNo5Tw\">Tutorial 2</a></strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p>* FOSSEE, IIT Bombay, has a group of Faculty Members (<a href=\"https://cfd.fossee.in/faculty-partners\">Faculty Partners</a>)&nbsp; who guide the students along with the <a href=\"https://cfd.fossee.in/advisory_board\">Advisory Board Members</a> who are professionals from the CFD industry. Fellows who are staying at IIT Bombay campus during the fellowship could be guided by faculty members who are not professors from IIT Bombay.&nbsp;</p>\r\n',	'',	'full_html'),
('list_of_faculty_partners',	0,	331,	331,	'und',	0,	'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">Dr. Ajit Balakrishna has more than 25 years experience in the application of CFD to industrial reactors, especially in the field of semiconductor equipment. He graduated with a BTech in Chemical Engineering from IIT Bombay in 1989 and went to do his PhD at the University of Minnesota under the guidance of Profs Lanny Schmidt and Rutherford Aris. He then did a postdoc with Prof Klavs Jensen at MIT before joining Applied Materials in 1997. He has been at Applied through most of his career, except for a short stint at Novellus (now Lam) and a software startup. He has over 20 patents, derived from the application of simulation. One of these patents was selected as an Applied Materials Patent of the Year in 2018 and inducted into their Hall of Fame in 2021. His current interests are in the areas of digital twins, and the interface between emerging AI technologies and simulations.</span></p>\r\n',	'',	'full_html'),
('list_of_faculty_partners',	0,	332,	332,	'und',	0,	'<p>Alok embarked on his career as a Programming Instructor while pursuing his Master&amp;#39;s in Hydro and Renewable Energy at IIT Roorkee in 2014. He simultaneously shared his expertise in mini-hydropower systems with postgraduate students at Lovely Professional University, Punjab, while<br />\r\nteaching Foundation Engineering to undergraduates. Prior to joining Ecofrost Technologies in 2015, he gained valuable experience through internships in Bengaluru, focusing on computational fluid dynamics and heat transfer. At Ecofrost Technologies (an Ecozen company), Alok spearheaded the development of a solar micro cold storage utilizing vapor compression refrigeration and thermal energy storage. Working closely with a team of engineers and agricultural scientists, he successfully addressed on-farm challenges, resulting in a scalable and serviceable product with over 1200 units deployed across India, Southeast Asia, and Africa.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Currently, Alok leads the R&amp;amp;D team at Ecozen, focusing on new product development and thermalen gineering research to enhance post-harvest quality and cold chain packaging for perishable produce. He leverages both commercial and open-source solutions for FEA and CFD to address technical challenges.<br />\r\nAlok holds two technology patent applications, with one granted, for innovative cold thermal energy storage solutions integrated into new product development. He holds interests in heat exchangers, refrigeration technologies, electronic cooling and phase change materials.</p>\r\n',	'',	'full_html'),
('page',	0,	333,	333,	'und',	0,	'<h1><u>&nbsp;Faculty Partners Roles &amp; Responsibilities</u></h1>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h1 class=\"page-title\">Coaching Partners</h1>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>Guide 1 summer fellowship or semester long internship student of the OpenFOAM Project, FOSSEE, IITB, to produce a case study/ research migration/ lab migration project&nbsp;or publish a conference paper acknowledging the FOSSEE project, IIT Bombay.</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 300px;\">OR</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>Deliver a talk and participate in any workshop/ seminar/ conference organized by the OpenFOAM Project, FOSSEE, IIT Bombay.</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h1 class=\"page-title\">Executive Partners</h1>\r\n\r\n<p><u>Roles &amp; Responsibilities</u></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Option 1</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Guide 1 or more summer/ semester long internship student of the OpenFOAM Project, FOSSEE, IITB, to produce a case study/ research migration/ lab migration projects&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;PLUS</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Participate&nbsp;in any workshop/ seminar/ conference organized by the OpenFOAM Project, FOSSEE, IIT Bombay</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;<strong>Option 2</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Guide 1 summer/ semester long internship student of the OpenFOAM Project, FOSSEE, IITB, to produce a case study/ research migration/ lab migration projects&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; PLUS</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Contribute to our Lab Migration Project (Course update needed every 4 years)&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Option 3</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Encourage 4 students per year to submit case studies, research migration projects and research papers for conferences and journals&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h1 class=\"page-title\">Senior Executive Partners</h1>\r\n\r\n<p><u>Roles &amp; Responsibilities</u></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Option 1</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Guide 3 students under the FOSSEE Fellowship (Summer intern/ semester long intern)</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 90px;\">PLUS</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Contribute to our Lab Migration Project (Course update needed every 4 years)</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 90px;\">PLUS</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Encourage 3 students per year to submit case studies, research migration projects and research papers for conferences and journals&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 90px;\">PLUS</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Contribute in our training workshops throughout the year, as a mentor</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Option 2</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Organize a one-day event (conference/ introductory workshop/ competition) to invite institutes in your district/ state to promote the OpenFOAM Project of FOSSEE, IIT Bombay.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n',	'',	'full_html'),
('news_and_events',	0,	334,	334,	'und',	0,	'<p>FOSSEE, IIT Bombay, offered a free Online Workshop on the Basics of OpenFOAM, for all CFD enthusiasts on 18th March 2025.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Recording of the session are available at&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@StudioIITBombay\">https://www.youtube.com/@StudioIITBombay</a></p>\r\n',	'',	'full_html'),
('news_and_events',	0,	336,	336,	'und',	0,	'<p>======================================================================================================================</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The Faculty Development Program was organised in June 2025 to impart knowledge to the faculty members to solve CFD problems while understanding the intricacies involved in simulations through a robust at the same time easy to use CFD tool box- OpenFOAM.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>At the end of this workshop, participants learnt-</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>how to set up, view the files and run a case in OpenFOAM&nbsp;</li>\r\n	<li>to become familiar with pre-processing tools and will be able to generate mesh, set the boundary &amp; initial conditions, learn simulation control etc.</li>\r\n	<li>how to plot and visualise the results in ParaView.</li>\r\n	<li>how to use a turbulence model in a simulation and to compare the results from a simulation using different turbulence models.</li>\r\n	<li>how to apply higher-order numerical schemes in CFD simulations.</li>\r\n	<li>to simulate multiphase flows.</li>\r\n	<li>about Dynamic meshing.</li>\r\n	<li>to add a scalar transport equation in a solver.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>The Faculty members who attended the program was benefitted by-</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Learning fundamentals of CFD using OpenFOAM&nbsp;</li>\r\n	<li>Learning to simulate problem in OpenFOAM&nbsp;</li>\r\n	<li>Learning essentials of post-processing&nbsp;</li>\r\n	<li>Receiving certificate for attending the 4 day OpenFOAM learning program</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>The video recording of the Faculty Development Program 2025 is available <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL_uaeekrhGzJ3mBSR77IL5NVfElNsFKj_\">here</a>.</p>\r\n',	'',	'full_html'),
('dummy_content_type_for_testing_c',	0,	338,	338,	'und',	0,	'<p>This is my text</p>\r\n\r\n<h1>This is my text</h1>\r\n',	'',	'full_html'),
('list_of_faculty_partners',	0,	339,	339,	'und',	0,	'<p><strong>Designation:</strong><br /><br />Assistant Professor <br /><br /><strong>Institute:</strong><br /><br />Lund University, Sweden<br /><br /><strong>Profile</strong>: https://portal.research.lu.se/en/persons/himani-garg<br /><br /><strong>LinkedIn Profile</strong>: https://www.linkedin.com/in/himani-g-4977b0256/<br /><br /><strong>Areas of interest:</strong> Non-Newtonian Flows; Turbulence; Multiphase flows; Heat Transfer, Fuel cells/electrolyzers</p>\r\n\r\n',	'',	'full_html'),
('list_of_faculty_partners',	0,	340,	340,	'und',	0,	'<p><strong>Designation</strong></p>\r\n<p>Assistant Professor</p>\r\n<p><strong> Institute</strong></p>\r\n<p>IIT Bombay</p>\r\n<p>Profile:<a href=\"https://www.che.iitb.ac.in/faculty/amol-subhedar\">Available here</a> </p>\r\n<p>Areas of interest: </p>\r\n<div id=\"research-area\" class=\"research-area tab-pane fade stage-content-biog active in\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Computational fluid dynamics</li>\r\n<li>Mathematical modelling</li>\r\n<li>Heat and Mass Transfer</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<p>Students Guided</p>\r\n<p>Rajnish Kaushal</p>\r\n<p>Institute: National Institute of Technology, Kurukshetra</p>\r\n<p>Link to the Case Study Project: <a href=\"https://cfd.fossee.in/case-study-project/case-study-run/297\">Here</a></p>',	'',	'full_html'),
('list_of_faculty_partners',	0,	341,	341,	'und',	0,	'<div class=\"field field-name-body field-type-text-with-summary field-label-hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"field-items\">\r\n<div class=\"field-item even\">\r\n<p><strong>Designation: </strong>Assistant Professor <br /><br /><strong>Institute: </strong>Pandit Deendayal Energy University<br /><br /><strong>Profile</strong>: <a href=\"https://orsp.pdpu.ac.in/adminfacviewprofile.aspx?facid=anirudh.kulkarni\">here</a></p>\r\n<p><br /><strong>LinkedIn Profile</strong>: <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/anik/\">here</a></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Internship Guided:</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Name: </strong>Rohin Kappillil Rajeev<strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Link to the Case Study Project:&nbsp;</strong><a href=\"https://cfd.fossee.in/case-study-project/case-study-run/292\">here</a></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>',	'',	'full_html'),
('list_of_faculty_partners',	0,	342,	342,	'und',	0,	'<div class=\"field field-name-body field-type-text-with-summary field-label-hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"field-items\">\r\n<div class=\"field-item even\">\r\n<p><strong>Designation: </strong>Assistant Professor <br /><br /><strong>Institute: </strong>Sanjeevani College of Engineering<br /><br /><strong>Profile</strong>: <a href=\"https://sanjivanicoe.org.in/index.php/component/k2/item/170-y-h-ahire\">here</a></p>\r\n<p><br /><strong>LinkedIn Profile</strong>: <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/yogesh-ahire-82096028/\">here</a></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Internship Guided:</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Name: </strong>Hyzam Kaliyadan<strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Link to the Research Migration Project:&nbsp;</strong><a href=\"https://cfd.fossee.in/research-migration-project/research-migration-run/63\">here</a></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>',	'',	'full_html'),
('list_of_faculty_partners',	0,	343,	343,	'und',	0,	'<p><strong>Designation</strong></p>\r\n<p>Honorary Assistant Professor</p>\r\n<p><strong> Institute</strong></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Academy of Scientific and Innovative Research.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\">LinkedIn Profile: <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/manabendra-de-a8a74a118/\">here</a><br /></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Area of Expertise&nbsp;</strong> External Aerodynamics of Aircrafts, Urban Air Platforms, MBSE<br />Unmanned Aerial Platforms, Wind Turbine Rotor Aerodynamics<br /><br /><strong>Specialisation:</strong> Computational Fluid Dynamics (using Open source and<br />proprietary software), Turbomachines, Wind Turbines,<br />Systems Engineering, Bionic Engineering</span></p>\r\n<p><strong>Students Guided:</strong></p>\r\n<p>Manu Aryal</p>\r\n<p>Institute: Tribhuvan University, Nepal</p>\r\n<p>Link to Manu\'s internship project work: <a href=\"https://cfd.fossee.in/case-study-project/case-study-run/298\">here</a></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>',	'',	'full_html'),
('list_of_faculty_partners',	0,	344,	344,	'und',	0,	'<p>Mr. Ranjit is a Water Resources Engineer specialized in Numerical Modelling of Open Channel Flows. He has an experience in simulating wide range of Civil &amp;<br />Environmental flow problems. He has also trained international teams and Post-graduate students in Numerical Modelling &amp; CFD.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Areas of interest:&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ol start=\"1\">\r\n<li>\r\n<div>Design and analysis of drop shafts</div>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<div>Analysis of flow distribution in treatment trains for Wastewater Treatment Plants (WWTP)</div>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<div>Design and analysis of conveyance conduit and outfall for WWTP</div>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<div>Analysis of pump storage hydro plant intakes and tailrace channel</div>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>LInkedIn Profile</strong>: Click <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/ranjit-desai-6767a5a2/\">here</a></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>',	'',	'full_html'),
('list_of_faculty_partners',	0,	345,	345,	'und',	0,	'<div>Mr. Harish Jayaraj is a Computational Fluid Dynamics (CFD) engineer with expertise in ANSYS Fluent, OpenFOAM and numerical modeling. His work focuses on utilizing commercial tools and customizing open-source solvers for industrial and research applications, particularly in multiphase flows, HVAC, and external aerodynamics.</div>\r\n<div>Alongside his engineering practice, he is a Python developer specializing in desktop software development for scientific computing, building tools that enhance simulation workflows.</div>\r\n<div>He also contributes to the CFD community through Codeynamics, an initiative dedicated to creating structured learning resources, tutorials, and practical content that make OpenFOAM and applied CFD more approachable. Through platforms like Udemy and YouTube, Codeynamics has helped learners worldwide strengthen their skills in CAD, CFD and scientific computing.</div>\r\n<div>With a long-term vision of advancing CFD technologies, he is committed to developing innovative solutions and creating platforms that bring high-end simulation tools closer to engineers, researchers, and industries.</div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n<p><strong>Areas of interest:&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Multiphase flows</li>\r\n<li>External Flows and HVAC</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;<strong>LInkedIn Profile</strong>: Click <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/harish-jayaraj-p-60a189195/\">here</a></p>',	'',	'full_html'),
('news_and_events',	0,	347,	347,	'und',	0,	'<p>Registration for the FOSSEE Semester Long Internship, Autumn 2025, is going on. Last date approaching soon (15th Sept).</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For timeline, extensions, screening tasks and other details, please watch out for updates at&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://fossee.in/Semester-Internship/Autumn/2025\">https://fossee.in/Semester-Internship/Autumn/2025</a></p>\r\n',	'',	'full_html'),
('list_of_faculty_partners',	0,	348,	348,	'und',	0,	'<p><strong>Designation:&nbsp;</strong>Assistant Professor</p>\r\n<p><strong>Department:&nbsp;</strong><em>&nbsp;</em>Aeronautical Engineering Department<br /><strong>Institute:&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>Institute of Aeronautical Engineering<br /><br /><strong>Profile</strong>:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.iare.ac.in/?q=aeronautical-engineering/dr-juluru-sandeep\">here</a></p>\r\n<p><strong>LinkedIn Profile</strong>:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/dr-juluru-sandeep-b48490263/\">here</a></p>\r\n<p><strong>Areas of Interest in CFD:</strong>&nbsp;Aerodynamics and Unmanned Aerial Vehicles</p>\r\n<p><strong>Specialization:</strong>&nbsp;Hypersonic Intakes, Wind turbines, Supersonic Combustion, Toroidal Propellers</p>',	'',	'full_html'),
('page',	0,	350,	350,	'und',	0,	'<div><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"color:#2980b9;\"><strong>Upcoming Workshop:</strong></span></span></div>\r\n\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<div><span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">2 Day Symposium for OpenFOAM Users Community</span></strong></span></div>\r\n\r\n<div><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:#2980b9;\"><strong>Date:</strong></span><span style=\"color:#000000;\">&nbsp;Tentatively in Dec 2025 or Jan 2026 (to be announced shortly)</span></span></div>\r\n\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<div><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:#2980b9;\"><strong>Venue:</strong></span><span style=\"color:#000000;\">&nbsp;IIT Bombay</span></span></div>\r\n\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<div><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:#2980b9;\"><strong>Details:</strong></span><span style=\"color:#000000;\">&nbsp;This event will be exclusively for OpenFOAM users. A full day workshop on CFD using OpenFOAM is planned for the advanced level. Prior knowledge of CFD and OpenFOAM of intermediate level is mandatory. Talk sessions, poster presentation and a panel discussion are planned as a part of the symposium.&nbsp;</span></span></div>\r\n\r\n<div><span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\"><strong>==================================================================================================================</strong></span></div>\r\n\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<div><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">YouTube recording of the Industry Readiness Workshop on CFD held during 11-14 Nov 2025 is available<span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\">&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/c/studioiitbombay/live\"><span style=\"color:#2980b9;\">here</span></a>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\">.&nbsp;</span></span></strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<div><span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>Details regardinbg the Industry Readiness Workshop:&nbsp;</strong></span></span></div>\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<div><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">This workshop witnessed&nbsp;hundreds of CFD enthusiasts being introduced to the ongoing problems from the CFD industry. The workshop participants attended multiple demonstration sessions referred from the <a href=\"https://cfd.fossee.in/case-study-project/completed-case-studies\">Case Study Project</a>&nbsp;of CFD FOSSEE followed by the corporate lectures.&nbsp;The Case Studies demonstrated during the workshop were relevant to the topic on which the Advisory Board Members lectured resulting in a synchrony of a virtual industry visit and academic reference.&nbsp;</span></div>\r\n\r\n<div><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">This workshop received an overwhelming response of over 1800 partipants showed interest to attend it. The informative lecture sessions were dcelivered by the CFD professionals from private as well as public sectors, MSMEs as well as MNCs. The lecture sessions of this workshop are conducted by the esteemed members of the <a href=\"https://cfd.fossee.in/advisory_board\">Advisory Board</a>&nbsp;of CFD FOSSEE team.</span></div>\r\n\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<div><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Lecture Session Details-</span></strong></div>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><em>Modelling before manufacturing</em> by Mr&nbsp;Mr. Adwaith Gupta from&nbsp;Paanduv Applications Pvt. Ltd</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><em>Problems on CFD in Water Sector</em>&nbsp;by Mr. Ranjit Desai from&nbsp;WaterUnit Infrastructure Consultancy</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><em>Droplet Dynamics Across the Spectrum: From Traditional CFD to Modern ML-Based Models</em>, by Mr.&nbsp;Mr. Arnab Chakraborty from&nbsp;TCS Research and Innovation</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><em>Combustion simulation for large bore diesel engines</em> by Mr. Pushkar Sheth from&nbsp;Wabtec Corporation</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><em>Key skills for CAD and Meshing in Industrial Applications of CFD using OpenFOAM </em>by Mr. Nikhil Bhamare from&nbsp;CFD Baba Simulations Pvt. Ltd.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><em>Potential use of CFD for enhancing HVAC designs and applications</em> by Mr. Harish Jayaraj from&nbsp;Codeynamics</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><em>CFD Applications in the Marine Industry</em> by Dr. Joseph Prabhu from&nbsp;Indian Register of Shipping (IR Class)</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><em>Challenges in Renewable Energy Harvesting and solution expectancy from CFD community</em> by&nbsp;Dr. Manabendra M. De from CSIR-NAL</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<div><br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n<hr />\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<embed height=\"1587px\" src=\"https://static.fossee.in/cfd/posters/poster-openfoam.pdf\" type=\"application/pdf\" width=\"100%\"></embed></div>\r\n</div>\r\n',	'',	'full_html'),
('news_and_events',	0,	352,	352,	'und',	0,	'<div style=\"text-align:start\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-decoration-thickness:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color:initial\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">The Industry Readiness Workshop on CFD was conducted during 11-14 Nov 2025 in online mode by FOSSEE, IIT Bombay. More than 1800 CFD enthusiasts showed interest to attend the workshop and hundreds of learners were benefited by the 8 sessions conducted during the 4 Day workshop. The&nbsp; participants were&nbsp;introduced to the ongoing problems that are dealt with in the CFD industry by the&nbsp;<a data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://cfd.fossee.in/advisory_board&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1763552489568000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2A74JDYj1kzzPqzsZFySiY\" href=\"https://cfd.fossee.in/advisory_board\" style=\"color:#1155cc\" target=\"_blank\">Advisory Board Members</a>&nbsp;of the CFD FOSSEE team. They attended multiple demonstration sessions referred from the <span style=\"padding: 0px; border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); border-style: none; border-width: 0px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit\"><span style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"background-image:none\"><span style=\"background-position:0% 0%\"><span style=\"background-size:auto\"><span style=\"background-repeat:repeat\"><span style=\"background-origin:padding-box\"><span style=\"background-clip:border-box\"><span style=\"outline:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9) none 0px\"><span style=\"line-height:inherit\"><a data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://cfd.fossee.in/case-study-project/completed-case-studies&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1763552489568000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1mI7D0--jCMn2mqnTcFCco\" href=\"https://cfd.fossee.in/case-study-project/completed-case-studies\" style=\"color:#1155cc\" target=\"_blank\">Case Study Project</a></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> of CFD FOSSEE that followed</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align:start\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-decoration-thickness:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color:initial\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">&nbsp;the corporate lectures.&nbsp;The Case Studies demonstrated during the workshop were relevant to the topic on which the Advisory Board Members lectured, resulting in an amazing synchrony of a virtual industry visit and academic reference.&nbsp;</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align:start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align:start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align:start\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">YouTube recording of the Industry Readiness Workshop on CFD held during 11-14 Nov 2025 is available&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/c/studioiitbombay/live\">here</a>&nbsp;.</span></div>\r\n',	'',	'full_html'),
('news_and_events',	0,	353,	353,	'und',	0,	'<div style=\"text-align:start\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-decoration-thickness:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color:initial\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">The Industry Readiness Workshop on CFD was conducted during 11-14 Nov 2025 in online mode by FOSSEE, IIT Bombay. More than 1800 CFD enthusiasts showed interest to attend the workshop and hundreds of learners were benefited by the 8 sessions conducted during the 4 Day workshop. The&nbsp; participants were&nbsp;introduced to the ongoing problems that are dealt with in the CFD industry by the&nbsp;<a data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://cfd.fossee.in/advisory_board&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1763552489568000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2A74JDYj1kzzPqzsZFySiY\" href=\"https://cfd.fossee.in/advisory_board\" style=\"color:#1155cc\" target=\"_blank\">Advisory Board Members</a>&nbsp;of the CFD FOSSEE team. They attended multiple demonstration sessions referred from the <span style=\"padding: 0px; border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); border-style: none; border-width: 0px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit\"><span style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"background-image:none\"><span style=\"background-position:0% 0%\"><span style=\"background-size:auto\"><span style=\"background-repeat:repeat\"><span style=\"background-origin:padding-box\"><span style=\"background-clip:border-box\"><span style=\"outline:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9) none 0px\"><span style=\"line-height:inherit\"><a data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://cfd.fossee.in/case-study-project/completed-case-studies&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1763552489568000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1mI7D0--jCMn2mqnTcFCco\" href=\"https://cfd.fossee.in/case-study-project/completed-case-studies\" style=\"color:#1155cc\" target=\"_blank\">Case Study Project</a></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> of CFD FOSSEE that followed</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align:start\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-decoration-thickness:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color:initial\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">&nbsp;the corporate lectures.&nbsp;The Case Studies demonstrated during the workshop were relevant to the topic on which the Advisory Board Members lectured, resulting in an amazing synchrony of a virtual industry visit and academic reference.&nbsp;</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align:start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align:start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align:start\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">YouTube recording of the Industry Readiness Workshop on CFD held during 11-14 Nov 2025 is available&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/c/studioiitbombay/live\">here</a>&nbsp;.</span></div>\r\n',	'',	'full_html');
