(35,	3200,	3153,	'Mr',	'Ketan Prafull Kulkarni',	'+917058717155',	'Savitribai Phule Pune University',	'Sinhagad Academy Of Engineering',	'Email',	'',	'',	'',	'Nashik',	'422013',	'Maharashtra',	'India',	'Computational Fluid Dynamics Simulation and Analysis of Fluid Flow in Pipe: Effect of Fluid Viscosity',	NULL,	4,	2,	'simpleFoam',	'Computational_Fluid_Dynamics_Simulation_And_Analysis_Of_Fluid_Flow_In_Pipe:_Effect_Of_Fluid_Viscosity_By_Mr_Ketan_Prafull_Kulkarni',	'2',	NULL,	0,	'Dear Ketan Kulkarni,\r\n\r\nPlease remove the word experiment from this line \"The project aims to migrate\r\nthe study carried out by Baru et. al. Baru et al. conducted the experiments................. \" Baru et al. didn\'t perform any experiments. All of their work was done numerically, I believe what they meant was the different cases of numerical work, so it is kind of misleading to say that you are comparing your work with their experiment. Please correct this on your proposal and let me know when you submit it.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, I encourage you to add/ do more work than the paper you are referring to; the study from the paper is quite simple in the sense that the different cases with fuel oil, water, and alcohol are actually the same case, with only differences in viscosity. And flow through a pipe is a simple case which is why I want to encourage you that, after validating your result, maybe do something extra to stand out.\r\n\r\nBest Regards,\r\nAabhushan Regmi.',	1683701318,	1689618600,	1687024322,	NULL,	NULL),
