(195,	'und',	'node_search',	' fossee summer fellowship 2018 fossee summer fellowship 2018 please note that we are not receiving further proposals for case study project for fossee fellowship  to apply for regular case study project click here  fossee cfd team iit bombay invites applications for summer fellowship 2018 selected candidates will get an opportunity to do an internship in iit bombay  on open source cfd simulation under prof shivasubramanian gopalakrishnan from mechanical engineering department fellowship process  registration  the registrations for fossee summer fellowship 2018 are closed important dates  click here to know the important dates screening task  minimum 1 case study project  doing multiple case study projects will improve chances of fellowship  case study project involves solving a feasible cfd related problem statement of reasonable complexity in openfoam technical requirements   any student ug pg research scholars etc who has basic knowledge of computational fluid dynamics and openfoam  learn openfoam by visiting our spoken tutorials   procedure to submit   prepare a 1 page abstract describing the cfd problem statement make sure your proposal is not in the list under completed case studies and case studies in progress  to view a sample abstract click here once your proposal is submitted it will be reviewed and approved disapproved after receiving the approval of your proposal you can proceed to complete the case study project once you complet the project prepare a case study project directory in a zip format which has the following mesh file exported from cfd software like ansys gmsh salome or created using openfoam utilities simulated case directories using openfoam 404150 or foamextend 3140 contours plots and data files postprocessed using paraview and or python scripts minimum 3 page report of case study project in pdf format specifying software details and dependencies on other codes functions if any click here to download sample case study project directory submit the proposal and case study project directory in the submission portal if not selected for fossee fellowship your project s will still be evaluated under cfd case study project after submission submission portal  1 you will receive an email with the subject line fossee summer fellowship 2018 submission 2 click here to visit the submission portal and login with your username and password given in the email 3 select cfd openfoam   under my courses section to submit the task s  note  to consider for fossee fellowship 2018 the case study proposals should only be submitted in the moodle link using the username and password given in the registered email for fellowship program evaluation criteria   the completed case study project will be evaluated on complexity of the project validated results using other sources references quality of the report number of case studies submitted per candidate for any further queries contact us at  contactcfd at fossee dot in with subject line as  fossee fellowship 2018   sashirekha thu 2152018 1704  ',	0),
