(291,	'und',	'node_search',	' announcement for the fossee summer fellowship for openfoam project 2023 announcement for the fossee summer fellowship for openfoam project 2023 we are accepting invitation for the fossee summer fellowship for openfoam project 2023 students of any academic year with a basic knowledge of cfd can apply for the fellowship the duration of the fellowship is approximately 46 weeks and mode is online the only criteria to get selected is solving a screening task please find the details about the screening task as below  screening task for openfoam  flow past a prism  this task aims to find the drag and lift coefficients for flow around a triangular prism of length one meter as shown in the figure here applicants can submit the solution of the screening task at contactcfd fosseein screening task for openfoam gui    the cfdfossee team is developing a gui to enhance the convenience of creating openfoam cases this involves building a pyqt based nodeeditor to manipulate the contents of serialized data files such as a json the serialized data represents the various parameters required to build an openfoam case the screening task for openfoam gui and submission guidelines will be announced shortly payelm fri 3172023 1420 friday march 17 2023 1200  ',	0),
