(294,	'und',	'node_search',	' jobs jobs the openfoam project fossee iit bombay invites applications for fulltime employees to join as research assistants and research associates holders of bachelors and masters degrees in engineering can apply for the jobs knowledge of openfoam or python and blender are mandatory for the job application to apply for jobs please go through the links given below openfoam https drivegooglecom file d 1t7xknxnw6oqh4pr8ijcxe7dslc5lq8 view usp sharing openfoam gui https drivegooglecom file d 1qcp64hve7lbsjyyi1uuhe3ub2mcgfqv8 view usp sharing applicants can learn the mentioned software using selflearning tools known as the spoken tutorials available in the following links openfoam  https cfdfossee in resources previously completed case studies by the students across the country are available at  https cfdfosseein casestudyproject completedcasestudies python  https spoken tutorialorg tutorialsearch searchfoss python 343 searchlanguage english blender  https spoken tutorialorg tutorialsearch searchfoss blender search language english  the openfoam team of fossee iit bombay invites the students and faculty members of your institution to join us for a recruitment interaction session  to be held in the month of july 2023 please click here  to register yourselves for the event the former employees and interns of the openfoam team fossee iit bombay are placed in corporations like mercedesbenz tata motors ufi filters some of them are into academia in institutions eg the university of manchester tu braunschweig germany tu darmstadt germany iit bombay cusat mysore to view the testimonials of our former employees and interns please click here  to apply for the ra research assistant research associate positions for openfoam and openfoam gui development please submit your cv at contactcfd fosseein  sashirekha mon 5012023 1348  ',	0),
(297,	'und',	'node_search',	' testimonial by mr chaitanya apte testimonial by mr chaitanya apte payelm tue 7182023 1147 testimonial by mr chaitanya apte  fossee summer fellowship 2022 was the first time i used an open source software after working on openfoam i got to know what actually goes on behind the scenes in a cfd simulation unlike the commercial packages additionally i learnt a lot from the projects other interns were working on my mentor mano prithiviraj and guide prof naren were quite helpful throughout the internship i developed a holistic understanding of cae which helped me further in my career i think this fellowship is a good starting point for anyone interested in numerical simulations chaitanya apte vjti mumbai maharashtra yes  ',	0),
