(335,	'und',	'node_search',	' testimonial by mr rajdeep adak phd student at the arizona state university former reserach associate at fossee iit bombay  testimonial by mr rajdeep adak phd student at the arizona state university former reserach associate at fossee iit bombay payelm fri 5162025 1111 testimonial by mr rajdeep adak i joined fossee in 2021 as an intern i was deeply inspired by fossee s vision to develop free and opensource equivalents to industrial scientific software fossee is managed by the renowned faculty of iit bombay who make this endeavor possible at fossee i worked with prof j s murallidharan and prof prabhu ramachandran and developed software for fluid dynamics simulation the exposure to fluid mechanics helped me discover an interest in the broader field of dynamical systems today i m proud to be starting a phd at arizona state university in the same field tackling complex control problems in highprecision polymer manufacturing fossee has been instrumental in enabling me to reach the doorstep of a phd my research journey started at fossee and i still continue to assist the cfdfossee team fossee offers an excellent environment for students to explore research and take ownership of their work which i believe is paramount towards building a successful career in both industry and academia mr rajdeep adak phd student at the arizona state university former reserach associate at fossee iit bombay yes  ',	0),
(336,	'und',	'node_search',	' faculty development program on cfdopenfoam faculty development program on cfdopenfoam the faculty development program was organised in june 2025 to impart knowledge to the faculty members to solve cfd problems while understanding the intricacies involved in simulations through a robust at the same time easy to use cfd tool box openfoam at the end of this workshop participants learnt how to set up view the files and run a case in openfoam to become familiar with preprocessing tools and will be able to generate mesh set the boundary initial conditions learn simulation control etc how to plot and visualise the results in paraview how to use a turbulence model in a simulation and to compare the results from a simulation using different turbulence models how to apply higherorder numerical schemes in cfd simulations to simulate multiphase flows about dynamic meshing to add a scalar transport equation in a solver the faculty members who attended the program was benefitted by learning fundamentals of cfd using openfoam learning to simulate problem in openfoam learning essentials of postprocessing receiving certificate for attending the 4 day openfoam learning program the video recording of the faculty development program 2025 is available here  payelm fri 5232025 1718 friday may 23 2025 1200 events submitted by mcluret on fri 5302025 1005 permalink fdp  p hoping to gain knowledge p  log in or register to post comments  ',	0),
(337,	'und',	'node_search',	' testimonial by mr biraj khadka testimonial by mr biraj khadka payelm thu 5292025 1207 testimonial by mr biraj khadka fossee has been instrumental in shaping my path as a researcher i started as a summer intern where i performed a cfd simulation of singlephase flow in a stirred tank reactor using openfoam under the guidance of prof raghvendra gupta later as a research assistant i collaborated with prof janani srree murallidharan and the fossee team to develop openfoam tutorials and mentor interns i am currently a phd student specializing in biofluid dynamics and often rely on the core concepts and practical skills i gained through fossee the combination of highquality resources expert guidance and a collaborative environment makes it an exceptional learning platform i recommend fossee to anyone looking to build or strengthen their expertise in computational fluid dynamics biraj khadka phd student university of rochester yes  ',	0),
