(343,	'und',	'node_search',	' dr manabendra de dr manabendra de payelm fri 8082025 1534 designation honorary assistant professor institute academy of scientific and innovative research linkedin profile  here area of expertise  external aerodynamics of aircrafts urban air platforms mbse unmanned aerial platforms wind turbine rotor aerodynamics specialisation  computational fluid dynamics using open source and proprietary software turbomachines wind turbines systems engineering bionic engineering students guided  manu aryal institute tribhuvan university nepal link to manu s internship project work  here   ',	0),
(344,	'und',	'node_search',	' mr ranjit desai mr ranjit desai payelm mon 9012025 1250 mr ranjit is a water resources engineer specialized in numerical modelling of open channel flows he has an experience in simulating wide range of civil environmental flow problems he has also trained international teams and postgraduate students in numerical modelling cfd  areas of interest   design and analysis of drop shafts analysis of flow distribution in treatment trains for wastewater treatment plants wwtp design and analysis of conveyance conduit and outfall for wwtp analysis of pump storage hydro plant intakes and tailrace channel  linkedin profile  click here  waterunit infrastructure consultancy  ',	0),
(345,	'und',	'node_search',	' mr harish jayaraj mr harish jayaraj payelm tue 9092025 1221 mr harish jayaraj is a computational fluid dynamics cfd engineer with expertise in ansys fluent openfoam and numerical modeling his work focuses on utilizing commercial tools and customizing opensource solvers for industrial and research applications particularly in multiphase flows hvac and external aerodynamics alongside his engineering practice he is a python developer specializing in desktop software development for scientific computing building tools that enhance simulation workflows he also contributes to the cfd community through codeynamics an initiative dedicated to creating structured learning resources tutorials and practical content that make openfoam and applied cfd more approachable through platforms like udemy and youtube codeynamics has helped learners worldwide strengthen their skills in cad cfd and scientific computing with a longterm vision of advancing cfd technologies he is committed to developing innovative solutions and creating platforms that bring highend simulation tools closer to engineers researchers and industries  areas of interest  multiphase flows external flows and hvac  linkedin profile  click here founder codeynamics  ',	0),
(346,	'und',	'node_search',	' testimonial by mr jinu chandran fossee summer fellow openfoam category 2025 bits goa testimonial by mr jinu chandran fossee summer fellow openfoam category 2025 bits goa payelm fri 9122025 1607 testimonial by mr jinu chandran fossee summer fellow openfoam category 2025 bits goa fossee openfoam summer fellowship 2025 internship experience i am deeply grateful to fossee for selecting me for the summer fellowship program 2025 which has been an enriching experience that significantly enhanced my understanding of computational fluid dynamics through openfoam the fellowship was exceptionally wellorganised with weekly meetings as these regular sessions with the supervising professor allowed us to discuss progress address challenges and plan upcoming work effectively ensuring i could complete my internship objectives within the stipulated timeframe one of the program s greatest strengths was the mentor assignment system where having a dedicated mentor was invaluable particularly during the initial phases when navigating openfoam s complex interface and functionalities felt overwhelming learning that my internship work will be featured as a case study project on the fossee platform is incredibly motivating as this recognition not only validates the effort i invested but also serves as a strong incentive to continue my exploration of openfoam and computational fluid dynamics knowing that my work might help future learners navigate similar challenges and adds meaningful purpose to the entire experience again thank you for this incredible opportunity and the excellent support throughout the program best regards jinu chandran yes  ',	0),
(347,	'und',	'node_search',	' semester long internship autumn semester long internship autumn registration for the fossee semester long internship autumn 2025 is going on last date approaching soon 15th sept for timeline extensions screening tasks and other details please watch out for updates at  https fosseein semesterinternship autumn 2025 payelm fri 9122025 1639 friday september 12 2025 1200 news  ',	0),
(348,	'und',	'node_search',	' prof sandeep juluru prof sandeep juluru payelm mon 9222025 1723 designation  assistant professor department    aeronautical engineering department institute  institute of aeronautical engineering profile   here linkedin profile   here areas of interest in cfd   aerodynamics and unmanned aerial vehicles specialization   hypersonic intakes wind turbines supersonic combustion toroidal propellers  ',	0),
(349,	'und',	'node_search',	' testimonial by mr shreyas shrestha fossee summer fellow openfoam category 2025 tribhuvan university testimonial by mr shreyas shrestha fossee summer fellow openfoam category 2025 tribhuvan university payelm mon 10062025 1207 testimonial by mr shreyas shrestha fossee summer fellow openfoam category 2025 tribhuvan university fossee openfoam summer fellowship 2025 experience what started as a oneday workshop on the basics of openfoam turned into an incredible journey through the fossee summer fellowship 2025 after completing the screening activities i had the opportunity to work with supportive mentors who guided me throughout the project during my fellowship i worked on a research migration project that involved simulating nonnewtonian flows in openfoam this experience helped me develop practical skills in simulation from case setup and analysis to conducting research and writing papers beyond technical knowledge it taught me patience and the value of collaboration i am very grateful to the fossee team and my mentors for making this journey both memorable and impactful yes  ',	0),
(350,	'und',	'node_search',	' openfoam workshop openfoam workshop upcoming workshop    2 day symposium for openfoam users community date   tentatively in dec 2025 or jan 2026 to be announced shortly  venue   iit bombay  details   this event will be exclusively for openfoam users a full day workshop on cfd using openfoam is planned for the advanced level prior knowledge of cfd and openfoam of intermediate level is mandatory talk sessions poster presentation and a panel discussion are planned as a part of the symposium      youtube recording of the industry readiness workshop on cfd held during 1114 nov 2025 is available  here     details regardinbg the industry readiness workshop   this workshop witnessed hundreds of cfd enthusiasts being introduced to the ongoing problems from the cfd industry the workshop participants attended multiple demonstration sessions referred from the case study project  of cfd fossee followed by the corporate lectures the case studies demonstrated during the workshop were relevant to the topic on which the advisory board members lectured resulting in a synchrony of a virtual industry visit and academic reference this workshop received an overwhelming response of over 1800 partipants showed interest to attend it the informative lecture sessions were dcelivered by the cfd professionals from private as well as public sectors msmes as well as mncs the lecture sessions of this workshop are conducted by the esteemed members of the advisory board  of cfd fossee team  lecture session details modelling before manufacturing by mr mr adwaith gupta from paanduv applications pvt ltd problems on cfd in water sector  by mr ranjit desai from waterunit infrastructure consultancy droplet dynamics across the spectrum from traditional cfd to modern mlbased models  by mr mr arnab chakraborty from tcs research and innovation combustion simulation for large bore diesel engines by mr pushkar sheth from wabtec corporation key skills for cad and meshing in industrial applications of cfd using openfoam by mr nikhil bhamare from cfd baba simulations pvt ltd potential use of cfd for enhancing hvac designs and applications by mr harish jayaraj from codeynamics cfd applications in the marine industry by dr joseph prabhu from indian register of shipping ir class  challenges in renewable energy harvesting and solution expectancy from cfd community by dr manabendra m de from csirnal akshaythakur tue 10072025 1114  ',	0),
(351,	'und',	'node_search',	' testimonial by mr barani ilango balan fossee summer fellow from manipal institute of technology testimonial by mr barani ilango balan fossee summer fellow from manipal institute of technology payelm wed 10222025 1604 testimonial by mr barani ilango balan  fossee summer fellow from manipal institute of technology i am sincerely grateful to fossee for giving me the opportunity to be part of the summer fellowship program 2025 the experience has been truly transformative deepening my knowledge of computational fluid dynamics and enhancing my skills in openfoam the fellowship was very well structured with weekly review meetings that helped me stay on track and receive valuable feedback from my supervisor these sessions provided the perfect platform to discuss challenges refine approaches and maintain consistent progress throughout the project the guidance and mentorship i received were instrumental in helping me tackle complex simulation problems and improve both my technical and analytical understanding of cfd workflows one of the most rewarding moments was learning that my project will be featured as a case study on the fossee platform knowing that my work could assist future learners in understanding openfoam and its applications is both motivating and fulfilling i truly appreciate the entire fossee team for their constant support and encouragement throughout the fellowship this experience has been a major step forward in my journey as a cfd enthusiast and has strengthened my resolve to continue exploring advanced simulation research best regards barani ilango balan yes  ',	0),
(352,	'und',	'node_search',	' industry readiness workshop on cfd 1114 nov 2025 industry readiness workshop on cfd 1114 nov 2025 the industry readiness workshop on cfd was conducted during 1114 nov 2025 in online mode by fossee iit bombay more than 1800 cfd enthusiasts showed interest to attend the workshop and hundreds of learners were benefited by the 8 sessions conducted during the 4 day workshop the participants were introduced to the ongoing problems that are dealt with in the cfd industry by the  advisory board members  of the cfd fossee team they attended multiple demonstration sessions referred from the case study project of cfd fossee that followed the corporate lectures the case studies demonstrated during the workshop were relevant to the topic on which the advisory board members lectured resulting in an amazing synchrony of a virtual industry visit and academic reference youtube recording of the industry readiness workshop on cfd held during 1114 nov 2025 is available  here  payelm tue 11182025 1748 tuesday november 18 2025 1200 events  ',	0),
